<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MLK MLK MLK Holoholo Bibilia Translation</book>
  <para style="h">MALUKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwanda gûsoga gusintilwe no Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Malk</para>
  <para style="mt2">MUANDA GÛSOGA GUSINTILWE NO</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALUKO</para>
  <para style="imt">KITWELELO</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Mwanda Gûsoga gusintilwe no Maluko</char></para>
  <para style="iot">Mwanda Gûsho Gwimumo</para>
  <para style="io1">Mubambo gwa Mwanda Gûsoga 1.1-13</para>
  <para style="io1">Mugêlo gwa Yesû Mugalilaya 1.14—9.50</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesû waima Galilaya wagya Yelusalema 10.1-52</para>
  <para style="io1">Djênga lya nfulo mu Yelusalema no mu bibûndê bi kûbwêê no Yelusalema 11.1—15.47</para>
  <para style="io1">Kûsangûka kwa Yesû 16.1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Kûmoneka no kûsela kwa Kolo Yesû 16.9-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Bûsauli bwa Yoane mubatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoano 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Mubambo gwa Musahû Gûsoga gwa Yesû Kilisitu, Mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû, <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note>Monka mwa gusintêlwe mu bûkû lya mumoni Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Lola nikamutuma, ‘Mukendi wane kû gêbwa kobe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">Wê kalongya ndjêla kû gêbwa kobe.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isay 40.3</ref> </char>
    </note>Djûwê lya muntû wakûta kahûndû mu kianya:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Mwi gilongye ndjêla gya Kolo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Molole maêto gage!’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yoane usile wa batisha kûko ku kianya, mu kûsahûla lû batisho, “Kibalo kya lû lekelelo lwa bûbê.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bantû kuima mwalo gwa Bûyaudi bonse no kiba kyonse kya Yelusalema babele bamuikêla. Nobo besasile bûbê bwabo, wê babatishe mu lûdjê lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Mub 1.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yoane ûshalile bi shalanwa bi longesibwe, no mabisi ga ngamia no ki kadja kya kiseba mû lûbûnda lwage, kya kûlya kyage lûbele lugige no bûkê bwalûngû. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Noge ûsawêle wê sambile: “Nghimba gyane wê kasha gee wêno bûkome kû nêmba nene. Kwana nsinyonghoni ku kutama no kû djogya migosi gya mi kalabanda gyage. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nene na nimibatisha mu madjê, mone gee wêke mibatisha kwa Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûbatisibwa no kûtompibwa kwa Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matayo 3.13—4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />No kyaba kilya Yesû uikile kuima Nasaleti kibûndê kya Galilaya, ûbatisibwe no Yoane mu lûdjê lwa Yolo dani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Kyaba kyaimine mu madjê, ûmwene gûlû lya ûtûlwa no Mutêma gutukile egûlû lyage omwena nkûnda. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Mub 22.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:7">Mput 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isay 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Malk 9.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3.22</ref></char></note>No djûwê litegelelwe kuima mwigulu: “Gwee ûmwanane mu kampibwa. Wandê mulogêlelwe Nage.” <verse eid="MRK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Lûkwe lûmo ûlûlwêlwe no Mutêma kûgya mu kianya, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />wêkene kûko masigi makumi gana, ûtompilwe no Lyabola. Ûbele kûko amo no banyama ba mwilungu, no masalagulu gabele gamuêla kya kûlya.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa libeta beli bana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matayo 4.12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Kyaba Yoane lwa kwatilwe no kûbêkwa mu kikutu, Yesû ûgêle Galilaya ûsawêle Mwanda Gûsoga gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, wêsambile: <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mt 3.2</ref></char></note> “Kyaba kya gwanina, no Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwa shena! Mwisase no kwê tabêsha Mwanda Gûsoga!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Sigi limo, Yesû ûbele waêta kû nkondo gya siba lya Galilaya, wê bamwene balobi babêlê Simo no Andele mwanabo, babele balaba makila gabo munda gya madjê mu kwela misha kibalo babele balobi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesû wê balombwele: “Munonde no nene nsanimilonge kûba balobi ba bantu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Lûkwe lûmo, basigile makila gabo ba mulondile.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesû lwa gêlêlêle no lwendo, umumwene Shake,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> mwana wa Sebedayo, no Yoane mwanabo, babele munda gya bwato mu kûdjo bolola makila gabo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Onkao, Yesû wêbetile, nobo ba musigile shabo Sebedayo mu bwato amo no bengili, ba mulondile.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muntû wêno munyaga gûbê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesû no baana babuganga bage lwa batwelile mu kibûndê Kapelenaumu. Aliikile sigi lya kwêtûsha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note> Yesû ûtwelile mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi</char></note>, ûbambile kûlanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mt 7.28-29</ref></char></note>Bantû bonse bategelele begalagenie no milango gyage, kibalo wêbalangile nagwe nigee wêno kitenta, no anagwe balangi babisila.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />No mukyaba kyonka kikyo, mu nsese gyabo gya milombelo gya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi</char></note>, mubele muntû gûmo ubele no munyaga gûbê, ûtele kahûndû: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Yesû Munasaleti, twênobe kibalo kee? Washa kwê tûtobesha? Nankûmanya gwee weni, gwee wê Mulûmbûlûke utuminwe no Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesû wêgûkankêle gûlya munyaga gûbe kwabuusi, wêsambile: “Ûtakania no muime muntû gûdjû!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Gûlya munyaga gûbê gûmuninghinie kwa bumu muntû gûdjo, gumuimine no gulilile kwa djûê likata. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bonse begalagenie no babambile kwebûsenia besambile: “Mianda kêê gino? Milango giya gidjûle bûkome! Kibalo muntû gûdjû wagitakêsha minyaga gibê nogyo gya mukokela!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Lwendo lûmo, mwanda gwage gûgwanine mwalo gugima gwa Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa libaandia bantû bangê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Kyaba Yesû kyeimine mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi </char></note>, bagêle amo no Shake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> no Yoano mu nsese gya Simo no Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Mone, nyage bûko wa Simo, ûbele mutongi wa kisûngû, lwendo lûmo bamulombwele Yesû mwannda gwa gûlya madjû. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Umuikêle gûdjo madjû, umukwatile kûkûboko no kumwimika. Kisûngû kimulekele, no ûbambile kwêbatekela kyakûla.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Alishabele lêngolo, djûba bya lyawa kûtwela, bamuêlêle Yesû batongi bonse no bantû babele no minyaga gibê. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Bantu bonse bakibûndê bebungile mbelê gya mushango. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Noge Yesû ûwandishe bantû bengê babele no mitongo ala ala, ukumbile minyaga gingê. No egilekele minyaga kûnenghena, kibalo gimusingûlwêle gee nani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa saûla Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Djo lyage lukindwe nghimba gya kûkendûlûka, Yesû ubyukile kuima musense ûgele kûkabenga, no kûbamba kûlomba. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simo no benage bagêle kumukeba. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Nobo lwabamumwene, bamulombwele: “Bantu bonse bakûkûkeba.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Mone Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Tûbagale antû ange kûbibûnde bikûbwêê. Mwanda kasahûle kûko noko, kibalo kikyo ûkyanshêlêle.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mt 4.23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9.35</ref></char>
    </note>Ûgêle wasahûla mu nsese gyabo gya milombelo gya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi</char></note>, mumwalo gonse gwa Galilaya, no kûkûmba minyaga gibê.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa muhandia muntû wêno bûsûngû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Kusile kwelê muntû wa bûsûngû, umwigadjile no kumukutamina, no kumulomba, “Gwe kûkampwa,” “Wêbûnyonghona kumunkya.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Noge Yesû umukyêlêle lûsa holwele kûboko kwage, umukumine muntû gûdjo, umulombwele: “Nankampwa munkibwa.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Lwendo lûmo bûsûngû bwage bumwimine, no ûandile no kumunkibwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Onka alya Yesû umulombwele agyate bûkêle no kumulombola kwa kumukonkomeka, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Benlf 14.1-32</ref></char></note>“Lola, no kalomboli muntû mwanda gogonse. Nambo bagala wêlangêshe kwê mulambwili; no ûkalambûle mulambû mulagêlêle Musa kwa kumunkibwa kobe, kabe kamoni kwa balê.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Mone gûdjo muntû lweimine ûbambile kûbanga mianda ûtû ûtû. No kutûmbya gûlya mwanda, no Yesû anyonghwene byonka kûtwela mukibûndê kwa ûtû ûtû. Yesû wêkene andje gya bibûnde mukabenga, bantû bamugêlêle kuima mugela gyonse.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandia muntû wa bûlebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Nghimba gya masigi gasho Yesû wêbwêlêle byonka Kapelenaumu. Kyaba bantû lwa bategelele kwana wimunsese, <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />babûngakene bantû bengê hao, no hakûbele byonka antû noene mbelê gya mushango. Yesû ebele walibasawêla mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Bantû bamo basile, kumuêla muntongi wabûlebe mutwalwe no bantû bana. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Mone bandilwe kumushena Yesû kibalo kya kibûngo, baselile nage egûlû lya nsese basamwine nsansagûlu bûlûlê no abele Yesû. No abawêle kûsamuna batukishe mukabo gwabele mulalêle gûlya wabûlebe. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Noge Yesû lwemwene lwêtabêsho lwabo, umulombwele gûlya wa bûlebe: “Mwanane, walekelelwa bûbê bobe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />No bamo balangi babisila babele bekane kûko, babambile kwêbûsha mumitema gyabo: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Kibalo kyakêê muntû gûno wakwêsamba nansino? Wabedja Kabesha Mpûngû! Nani wêbûnyonghona kûlekelela bûbê? Nambo Kabesha Mpûngû bugima bwage!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yesû usingûlwêle onkalya bya babele baninga mu mitêma gyabo, wêbalombwele: “Kibalo kya kêê mwino gago maninga mu mitêma gyenyu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Kikê kiele mbeela kumulombola muntû wêno bûlebe: ‘Walekelelwa bûbê bobe,’ ao kwêsamba, ‘Gimana ûtwale kisalo kyobe, ûbagale?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Mone nankampwa mumanye kwana Mwana wa Muntû wêno kitenta mukandje kwa kûlekelela bûbê,” kwa nansho umulombwele gûlya wêno bûlebe: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nankûlombola gimana, ûtwale kisalo kyobe, ûgyate kû nsese gyobe!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Onkao, wêmene mbelê gya bantû bonse kûtwala kisalo gyage, uimine kûgêbwa kwabo bonse. No bantû bonse begalagenie, bamutumbikile Kabesha Mpûngû, banine: “Atwalimone mbeela mwanda bigûno!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wamwita Lefi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesû wêbwêlêle byonka kûnkondo gya siba lya Galilaya. Kibûngo kikata kya bantû kimugêlêle, noge ûbambile kwêbalanga. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />No ebele waêta, umumwene Lefi mwana wa Alufayo, ûbele wagikana mu nsese gya mingêlo gya kusonkesha musonko. Yesû umulombwele: “Nonde.” Onkao Lefi wêmene umulondile.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Byonka nansilya Yesû lwebele mwikane mukûlya kya kûlya mu nsese gya Lefi Basonkesha musonko no bangêla bibê beengê bekene kûlya kyakûlya amo no Yesû, no baana babuganga bage, kibalo bantû bangê bamuswelo gûgo babele bakumulonda. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />No kyaba balangi babisila, no Bafalisayo, lwabamumwene Yesû wakûlya amo no basonkesha musonko no beno bûbê, bebabulishe baana ba bûganga bage: “Kibalo kyakêê wakûlya amo no basonkya misonko no babûbê?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesû lwategelele mianda gilya gyabesambile wêbalombwele: “Bepoo habekûkeba mundahi, nambo balya bakusumwa no mutongo ûbekûkeba mundahi. Simushe kûkeba beno site mambo beno bûbê.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûsho kibalo kya kwigima kya kûlya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Sigi limo baana babûganga ba Yoane mu batisha no bafalisayo babele baligima kya kûlya. Nfulo bantû bamo basile kwê Yesû ba mubulishe: “Kibalo kyakêê baana babûganga ba Yoane mu batisha no balya baba falisayo ba kwigima kya kûlya, mone baana ba bûganga bobe haba kwigima kya kûlya?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesû wê baêndwêle: “Mwaninga kwana balya betilwe kû bûlûgo be bûnyonghona kûleke kya kûlya kya bûlûgo kyaba mwine bûlûgo ukiamo nabo? Ubisibyo! Kyaba kya bakii no mwine bûlûngo amo ha banyonghoni kûlekela kûlya. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Mone kyaba kikaika sigi kwana mulûme wa bûlûgo alê kasindûlwa, usigi lya balê kalekela kûlya kya kûlya.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Hakûlê muntû wêbûlamika kiba kya kilêba kiya kukilêba kikûlûkûlû, ge kûlonga nansho kilya kiba kiya kibikilwe shakyone kilêba kikûlûkûlû, no alya asanikile shaagêlêlêle kûsanika. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />No kwênghe muntû wêbûbêka difai liya munengo gikûlûkûlû, gekûba walonga nansho, lilya difai liya likaata nengo gilya. Lilya difai lyakesêka no gilya nengo gikoneka, nambo kûbêka difai liya munengo giya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kolo lya kwêtûsha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Ngib 23.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Sigi limo lya kwêtûsha lya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note>, Yesû ebele wakalûlûla mu mabala ga ngano, baana babûganga bage babambile kûolola miewe gya ngano. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Bafalisayo bamubulishe Yesû: “Lola! Kibalo kyakê baana babûganga bobe balonga kisi kiyenene sigi lya kwêtûsha lya Bayuda?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note><verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21.1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Benywe hamusomine bilongile Daudi no bantu bange kyaba kyakebile kya kûlya? Kibalo gee mwine no bantû bage bategelele ndjala, <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:9">Nghib 24.9</ref></char></note>ûtwelile mu nsese gya Kabesha Mpûngû. Kyaba kya mulambwili mukûlû Abiatali wigilêle mikate gilûmbûlûke. Giimibwe kibalo kya Kabesha Mpûngû kwana hagiyenene kûlêbwa nambo balambwiliyaa wêbaele no bantû bage byonka nansilya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesû wêbalombwele byonka: “Sigi lya kwetûsha lya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note> lilongilwe kibalo kya muntû; hamuntû kibalo kya sigi lya kwetûsha lya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kibalo kiki Mwana wa Muntû ûge Kolo wasigi lya kwetûsha lya Bayuda.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note><verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandia muntû wa kûboko kwa bûlebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yesû ûtwelile byonka mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi</char></note>, mubele no muntû gûmo ûbele no kûboko kwa bûlebe. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bafalisayo bamulwele soo Yesû, bamone ntêê shaandye sigi lya kwêtûsha lya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note>, kibalo bamone kumusongela. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesû umulombwele gûlya muntû wêno kûboko kwa bûlebe: “Gimana kûgêbwa kwa bantû bonse.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Yesû wêbabulishe: “Kikêê kitakisibwe kûlonga sigi lya kwêtûsha lya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note>? Kûlonga bisoga ao kûlonga bibêê? Kûhandya ao kweyaga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Bonse bekene talala. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesû wêbalwele kwansûngû, ûkolelwe biiko kibalo kya lûûma lwa mitêma gyabo. Yesû umulombwele gûlya muntû: “Golola kûboko kobe.” Noge olwele, kûboko kwage kwandile onka alya. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Onkao Bafalisayo baimine andje bebagêlêle bantû ba Helode, kûlonga sondjelo kibalo kyage bamone ndjêla gya kumwiyaga.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bantû bangê basile kwê Yesû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesû ûgele no baana babûganga bage kû nkondo gya siba lya Galilaya, kibûngo kikata kya bantû ki mulondile. Kuima Galilaya, no Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />no Yelusalema, no Idumaya, no bwala bwa Yolodano, no mugela gwa Tilo no Sidona. Kibûngo kikata lwa kitegelele musahû gwa mianda gyabele walonga ba mugêlêle. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Malk 4.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lk 5.1-3</ref></char></note>Kibalo kya bûngê bwa bantû, Yesû wê balombwele baana babûganga bage kwana mu mbêkêle bwato, kibalo kya kibungo na kikasi ku mpininika. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Nagwe nansilya byahandishe bantû bangê, bonse babele no mitongo babêngêle kwalê kibalo bamukume. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Kyaba bantû babele no minyaga gibe lwa bamumwene Yesû ba mukutamine kûgebwa kwage, no batele kahûndû besambile: “Gwe ûmwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Mone Yesû wê bakandile kwa busi na baka mu singûlûsha kû bantû.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wasolola bikula kumi no Bibêle</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Kûwa Yesû ûselile kûlûgûlû wê betile balya be kampilwe gee mwine. Bamugêlêle, <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />mu bûkata mwabalya bagitile ûsolwele bantû kumi no babêlê, bagitile bikûla, bekane amo nage, kibalo abe wa libatuma kûsahûla, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />byonka kwê batanga bûkome bwa kûkûmba minyaga gibê.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Lola bikûla kûmi no bibêlê ûbino: Simo, ûwelwe sina lya Petelo no Yesû, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Shake mwana wa Sebedayo no Yoane mwanabo, Yesû wê benikile sina lya Boanege, nsitwe gyage: “Baana ba mukuma gwa nkûba” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Filipo, Batolomayo, Mateo, Toma, Shake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> mwana wa Alufayo, Tadeo, Simo wa mumulongo gwa Baseloti, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Yuda Isikaliota, ûge gûlya umuiminie Yesû.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû no Belesebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayo 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Kyaba Yesû lwa gibwêlêle mu nsese, kibûngo kikata kibûngakene byonka. Kûba Yesû no baana babûganga bage ha banyonghwene no kwêne kûlya kya kûlya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Kyaba ba mbyalwa nage lwa bategelele mwanda gûlya, baimine kûgya ku mutwala Yesû kwabumu, kibalo bantû besambile: “Wa tumuka bûlûbê!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mt 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10.25</ref></char>
    </note>Nobo balangi babisila batukile kuima Yelusalema besambile nansino: “Wêno minyaga gya Belesebuli munda gyage! No kwa bûkome bwa mukûlû wa minyaga gibe wa kûkûmba minyaga.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Onkao Yesû wêbetile wê balombwele kwa nkêndê wê sambile: Mu nombole Satana wê bûnyonghona ku mukumba Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ntêê ba bûkolo bûmo bo kûsansûlûka, bûkolo bûbo abugililili. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Byonka bantû ba nsese gimo bo kûsansûlûka, nsese gigyo agigililili. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ntêê Satana gee kwê lwêsha gee mwine, no ntêê wa sansûlûka, bûkome bwage abugililili nambo sabuike nfulo.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Byonka hakûle muntû wê bûnyonghona kûtwela munda gya nsese gya muntû wêno bûkome, no kuswinia bintû byage ha kumuganga bêlê muntû gûdjo migosi, nambo saa mugange bêlê gûlya wêno bûkome; ao ûalê ka muswinia bintû byage bya mu nsese.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Sitêê na nimilombola, baana ba bantû beka lekelelwa bûbe bwabo bonse. No kûbedja kwabo konse kwa besambile kibalo kya Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Lk 12.10</ref></char></note>Mone ntêê muntû wa bedja Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke ha kalekelelwa. Wêno bûbê bwa miaka.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesû wê balombwele nansho kibalo besambile: “Kwana wêno minyaga gibê.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musoo gwa sitê gwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Kyaba kisile nyage wa Yesû no bamwanabo, bemene andje, batumine muntû ku mwita. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />No bibûngo bya bantû bangê bibele bi mwalagale Yesû, ba mulombwele: “Lola, nyobe no bakwa nyobe beandje, ba kûkûkeba.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesû ûêndwêle: “Nani madjû wane? No bambyalwa nane bani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Wê balwele balya babele ba mwalagale, wêsambile: “Lola! Madjû wane no bambyalwa nane! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Muntû gegense wê kalonga kiswa mutêma kya Kabesha Mpûngû, gûdjo ûmwanetû, no nkasibyala gyane, no hû madjû wane.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa mukusi wa nkunwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lk 5.1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû ûbambile kûlanga byonka kûnkondo gya kisiba lya Galilaya. Kibûngo kikata kya bantû ki mwalagele, noge ûbandile mu bwato wêkene mumo, kibûngo kyonse kibele kûntala kûkondo gya siba. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Wê balangile mianda gingê kûnkêndê, wê balombwele mu milango gyage, wêsambile:<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Mu tegelele! Mukuni ûgêle kukuna nkunwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Kyaba kyabele wakusa nkunwa, ginge nkunwa gi gwêlêle kûnkondo gya ndjêla: kusile toni twi gilêle. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ginge gi gwêlêle alwala, asibele no bûlongo bûnge. Gi menine lûkwe lûmo, kwa kûba ha kûbele bûlongo bûgê. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Mone djûba aliselile gi humine, kwakûba ha gibele no misi gi twele gihumine. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ginge gigwêlêle mu miba, kyaba miba agimenine gi ininikile gilya nkunwa, no hagiiminie kantû. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Ginge gi gwêlêle mu bûlongo bûsoga, gimenine no kûkûla no kûwaa bihelo: Gimo makumi gasatu, ginge makumi mutanda, no ginge lûkama.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Kûwa Yesû wêsambile: “Wêno matwê ga kûtegelela, ategelele!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walisamba kibalo kyakê wakûlonga kwa nkêndê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Kyaba kyabele bugima bwage, baana babuganga bage no kibungo kya bantû bonse, bamugêlêle no bamubulishe kibalo kya gigyo nkêndê. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Mone Yesû wêbaêndwele: “Benywe mwibalagêlêlwe kûmanya kibiso kya Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû, mone balya beandje, bakûtegelela mianda gyonse kûnkêndê <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isay 6.9-10</ref> </char></note>kûba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Bebûnyonghona kûlola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">No habamoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">No Bebûnyonghona kûtegelela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">No habasingûlûli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Ntêê hanansho bekamwibwêlêlêla Kabesha Mpûngû,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">No Kabesha Mpûngû wêkebalekelela.’”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wasintûlûla lûkêndê lwa mukuni wa nkunwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Nfulo Yesû wêbalombwele: “Lûlo lûkêndê amwibelûmanye? Musha mwigisingûlûle ntêê nkêndê ginge? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Nkunwa gilya gikusilwe ûmwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Ndjee gigwelêle kûnkondo gya ndjêla; ûbantû bakwêgûtegelela mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, onkao Satana washa no kusindûla gûlya mwanda gubikilwe munda gyabo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Ndjee gigwêlile egûlû lya lwala. Hûbantû balya bakûtegelela mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, lûkwe lûmo baligûtambûla kwa mulogo. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Mone gûlya mwanda gwênghe misi gya kûshama, bakwêgûkwatêsha kwa kyaba kisho. Kyaba kya mudjembo no masûsû kyokwêbaikêla kibalo kya mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, lûkwe lûmo bagwêla. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Ndjee gigwêlêle mumiba. Lûkêndê lwa bantû balya bakûtegelela Mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />mone mudjembo gwa kandje, no bûkampwe bwa lûheto, no kitêma kya mianda ginge gyo kûtwela no kuininika gûlya mwanda, no kûbûla kûwaa bihelo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ndjee gigwêlêle mu bûlongo bûsoga. Lûkêndê lwa bantû bakwêgûtegelela mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, no kwêgûtambûla, no kûwaa bihelo: Gimo bihelo makumi gasatû, no ginge bihelo makumi mutanda, no ginge lûkama.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêdê lwa Kimuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lk 11.33</ref></char>
    </note>Yesû wêbalombwele byonka: “Nani wêbûkûnkya kimuni kyage kûhûta no kitala ao kûbeka nkûnsê bûtanda? Nantê kûbêka egûlû lya lwagê? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mt 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lk 12.2</ref></char></note>Byonka nansho, bilya byonse bibisikilwe byakamanyinkana, no kibiso kyonse kyakabêkwa epee. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Muntû wêno matwê ga kûtegelela no ategelele!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mt 7.2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Lk 6.38</ref></char>
    </note>Yesû wêbalombwele byonka kwana: “Mube meso no mianda gyamulê mukûtegelelela! Kilêko kyamwa kûtûngêla bange, kyonka kilya kya balêkemitûngêla no benywe, no kwêmibilêsha mbeela. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mt 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25.29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lk 19.26</ref></char></note>Kibalo gûlya wêno kintû wêkaebwa kinge no tenteko, gûlya usino kantû no kalya kasho kelênako wêkaswinibwa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwandje gya kwêmenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesû wêsambile byonka: Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwêê gûlane. No muntû gûmo wakukusa nkunwa mwibala lyage. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Busigi ao djûba, ntêê gûlya muntû gee kona tûlo ao gee kûbyûka, gilya nkunwa shagikûlêle hakûmanya mwagilê mukûkûlêla <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Bûlongo bwêne bwamenia nkunwa, kûbambêla muntê, maani, kûlonda bihelo, nfulo nkunwa gyo kûkomena munda gya miewe. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Mone bimbûlwa abyawa kû gwanina lûkwe lûmo mulimi kûtwela mwi bala no kahêlû kakwêmbûla, kibalo bimbûlwa abidjambûla.<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa ndjee gya Kilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13.31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesû wêsambile byonka: “Twêbwêgûshe no kêê Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû?” Ao “Twêbûbêke mu lûnkêndê kêê? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Bûkolo bwa mwigûlû bwênagwe ni ndjee gya kilanga. Gikuninwe mu bûlongo, nogyo gike kûlêmba ndjee gyonse gya kandje. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Mone gyo kûwa kukunwa no kûkûla, gikaba gikata kûlêmba nkunwa gyonse. Gikaimia matabê gakata no toni twaegûlû twêbûnyonghona kuimpa binswa byabo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesû ûbele walibalanga kûnkêndê giingê gya miswelo gûgo, kwa kûlanga mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû; kwa kilêko kyabalê bûtegelela. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yesû hesambile nabo kintû kyokyonse no hakûbûla kûbêka lûkêndê, mone abele bugima no baana babûganga bage, wêbasintûlwele bintû ûtû ûtû.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû watakêsha munyaga gûtalale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Sigi lilya, kyaba kya lêngolo, Yesû wêbalombwele baana ba bûganga bage: “Tûdjabûke bwala bwabûbê bwa siba.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Kwanansho bekisigile kibûngo; batwelile mu bwato mubele Yesû, no kûsemuka amo nage. No maato gaange gebasindêkêle. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Munyaga gûkata guumpile mwisiba, mabêmbê gakata gaumpile bwato, bwato bûbambile kûdjûla madje. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />No Yesû ûbele kunghimba gya bwato mulale tûlo, wale mubêke twee lyage kumusego. Baana babûganga bage bamubyulile Yesû mukûbûlûla: “Mulangi, twa kyaa, hakintû kole ntêê twa tobêla?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesû ubyukile, wêgûkankele munyaga: “Talala!” No kulombola siba “Kokela!” Munyaga gûwêle akûbele talala nya. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesû wêbalombwele baana babûganga bage: “Kibalo kya kêê mwatûdjûka? Amwalibe no lwêtabêsho?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Batûdjûkile biiko besongenie: “Gûdjû noge nani! Watalasha munyaga no siba lya mukokela!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa muhandya muntû wêno minyaga gibê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesû no baana ba bûganga bage, baikile kûbwala bûnge bwa siba lya Galilaya, mumwalo gwa Bagelasi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">gerase</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Kyaba Yesû kyetukile mubwato, muntû gûmo ûbele no minyaga gibê. Uimine kûbilêbû usile mbelê gyage. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Gûlya muntû wêkene kûbilêbû, no hakûbele muntû ûnyongwene kûmukwêka midjololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Mako gangê ûbele no byuma kûmagûlû no midjololo kû maboko, mone utimwine byuma no midjololo gyonse. Kubulile muntû ûbele no bûkome bwa kumunyonghona. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Kyaba kyonse bûsigi no djûba, ûbele walelemba lelemba mubilêbû no kûngûlû, mukûbûlûla no kwêkoma koma gee mwine no mabwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Lwamumwene Yesû kûlampee, ûgêle lûbêlo no kumukutamina mbelê gyage, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />no kwangûla djuê likata no kwêsamba: “Yesû Mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû wimwigûlû! Kwê kibalo kêê abûkata bobe gwe no nene? Nankwêsasa musina lya Kabesha Mpûngû, noka nyembia!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Kwakûba Yesû umulombwele: “Munyaga gûbê, muime muntû gûdjo!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Nfulo, Yesû umubulishe: “Sina lyobe wini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Noge umuêndwêle: “Sina lyane kibûngo kya Basilêkale,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Legioni</char></note> kibalo twê bangê!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Munyaga gûbê gûmwisasile Yesû kwana, nekegikumbi gilya minyaga gibê andje gya mwalo gûlya.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />No kûko kûlûgûlû kûbele kibûngo kikata, kya ngûlûbê mukûlya. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Nfulo, minyaga gibê gimwisasile Yesû gisambile: “Wêtûtakêshe mungûlûbe gilya, tûtwele mo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesû wigitakêshe, gilya minyaga gibê giimine munda gya muntû gûlya no gitwelile mu ngûlûbe. Mulongo gûkata gwa ngûlûbe giikile elufu libêlê gitukile lûbelo kuima kûlûgûlû no kûtwela mwisiba nogyo gitobele mumadjê.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Baleli bagilya ngûlûbe batinine lûbêlo kuila musahû mukalya no tubibûndê, no bantû basile kûmona bilya bilongekile. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Kyaba bantû abamugêlêle Yesû, bamwene gûlya muntû ûbele no minyaga gibe. Mwikane ansê, ûshête bishandê no ngheni gyage gigwane; nobo batudjukile. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />No balya bamwene biitikile bebalombwele baange bilya bilongikile kûgûlya muntû ûbele no minyaga gibe, no kugilya ngûlûbe.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Babambile kumwisasa Yesû asemuke mu mwalo gwabo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Kyaba Yesû abele wabanda mu bwato, gûlya muntû ûbele no minyaga umwisasile, agye amo nage.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesû umubengelele, mone umulombwele kwana: “Gyata kû nsese gyobe, no kumusoo gobe, wêbalombole bikata byene kûlongela Kolo, no mwakûmwenene lûsa.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Gûdjo muntû ûgêle lwege, ûbele wagya watûmbya mumwalo gwa bibûndê kumi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapoli</char></note> Byonse Yesû byemulongêle, no bantû bonse bamutegelele begalagenie biiko.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandya mwana mukasi gûmo no washûla nsongwa kasi wa Yahilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Kyaba Yesû egibwêlêle bwala bwa bûbele bwa siba, kibûngo kya bantû kimwalagele. Gee ûbele mwimane kûnkondo gya siba. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Onkao asile muntû gûmo mûkûlû wa sense gya milombelo gya Bayuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi</char></note> sina lyage Yailo. Kyaba kwamumwene Yesû, umugwêlêle kûmagûlû gage. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />No umwisasile biiko no kwêsamba: “Mwanane nsongwa kasi wêabûsho kûkya. Nankwêsasa ndjûû umutenteke maboko, kûba ahande no kwêkana!”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Onkao Yesû ûgêle amo nage no kibûngo kikata kimulondile, balê bamuhininike mugela gonse.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Mu bûkata bwabo mubele mwana mukasi gûmo ûbele no mutongo gwa sûngwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mudjamba nsûsa</char></note> mu kyaba kya miaka kumi no gibêle. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />U susukile kû maboko ga batembi bangê. Noge usiminie lûheto lûngê, hamwene lûhandêlo ngikeno gyage gigêlêlêle kûba gibê. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Kyaba kyategelele musahû gwa Yesû, usile no kûtwela mubûkata bwa kibûngo kya bantû, wêmene nghimba gya Yesû no kukuma nkanso gyage. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Wêsambile mumutêma gwage: “Ntêê nene kukuma bishandê kyage shampande.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Onka alya kûsûswa kwa masi gage gakamine; noge wêtegeleshe kwana wahanda. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Onkao, Yesû usingûlwêle kwana bûkome bûmo bumuimine. Wêhûgulukile kwê kibûngo wêsambile: “Nani wakuma bishandê byane?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Baana babûganga bage bamuêndwêle: “Onokûmona kibûngo byakilê kikwiininike mugela gonse; wêbûbûsha ntêê kwana wakuma nani?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Mone Yesû ûlwele mugela gonse kibalo amwne muntû gûlya ûlongile nansho. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Gûlya mwana mukasi, utudjukile, no kûkwaka kibalo ûmanyine byonse bimuimine, usile kûgwêla kûmagûlû ga Yesû no kumulombola sitêê. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Mone Yesû umulombwele: “Nsongwa kasi wane, lwêtabêsho lobe lwa kûhandya. Bagala no angalê, mutongo gobe gwahanda mbeela.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Kyaba Yesû kyabele walisamba, bantû basile kû nsese gya Yahilo bamulombwele: “Nsongwa kasi obe wawa kûkya, kibalo kyakê wamudjembya mulangi?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Mone Yesû halwele mwanda gwêsambilwe umulombwele: “Yahilo no katudjuki gitabêsha yaa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />No hatakêshe muntû alondane nage nambo Petelo, Shake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> no Yoano mwanabo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Lwabaikele kû nsese gya Yahilo, Yesû ûmwene bantû balê mpewa mpewa, mukûlêla no djûê likata. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ûtwelile mu nsese wêbalombwele: “Kibalo kyakê mwimpewa mpewa no malelo? Mwana hawakûkya, ûbêdjê!”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Mone bantû bamwadjile. Onkao Yesû wêbaiminie bonse andje, usigile shage no nyage wa mwana no baana babûganga bage bamusindêkêle, ûtwelile nabo mukyumba kya sense mubele mulale mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Ûkwatile kûboko kwa mwana umulombwele: “Talita, kumi,” nsitwe gyage, “Nsongwa kasi, nankûlombola byûka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Lwendo lûmo gûlya nsongwa kasi wêmene no kûbamba kûtamba. (Gûdjo nsongwa kasi ûbele no miaka kumi no gibêlê.) No bantû lwabamwene kilya kilongekile, begalagenie. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yesû wêbakandile na bakalomboli muntû byagêlêka no wêbalombwele: “Bamuwe nsongwa kasi kya kûlya alye.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bantû Banasaleti bamubenga Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Kûwa Yesû kuima kûsense gya Yahilo, wêbwêlêle kûkibûnde kyage kya byalilwe Nasaleti, baana babûganga bage bagêle amo nage. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Sigi lya kwêtûsha lya Bayuda aliikile,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sigi lya Sabato</char></note> Yesû ûbambile kûlanga mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi</char></note> Bantû bamutegelele ao begalagenie biiko bebulishe: “Muntû gûdjû mianda gino waligiimya kwêê? Nani ûmuele lweni lwamuswelo gûgû? No Bûkome bwa kûlonga byesha bibi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Gûdjû nantê ûgûlya ngino gya bibale, mwana wa Malia, mukwa nyage no Shake,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yokobo</char></note> Yose, Yuda no Simo? No bankasi byala gyane nantê bekane amo netu?” No kwabibyo byonse bakolelwe biiko bandilwe kûmwitabêsha.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yoa 4.44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mone Yesû wêbalombwele: “Mumoni enabûnyeme mu mwalo gwage, ku muso gwage, no kû nsese gyage.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />No hanyonghwene kûlonga byesha kûko, nambo kûbatongi basho betentekile maboko no kwebahandya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Noge wêgalagenie biiko, kibalo kya lûhûma lwa Mitêma gyabo.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû watuma baana babûganga balya kumi no babêlê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yesû wêbetile baana babûganga bage kumi no babêlê, no ûbambile kutuma babêlê babêlê. Gee kwêbaha bûkome bwa kûkûmba minyaga gibê. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lk 10.4-11</ref></char></note>Wêbalagile wêsambile: “Na mukatwali kintû kyokyonse mulwendo lwenyu nambo lûbango yaa, na mukatwali kya kulya kya mundjêla, no gwêne mutûngû no lwêne lûheto mukikadja. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Nambo mushale mikalabanda, mone na mukatwali bishandê bibêlê.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Wêbalombwele byonka: “No antû honse abalê kemikûnka munda gya nsese, mwikane mumo kuikêla sigi lya mulêkaima mumo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Bilb 13.51</ref></char></note>Mpenga gyonse gya basi kemikûnka benywe no kûbûla kwêmitegelela, amulê kaima kûko mukakûnkûle lûbimbi lwê kûmagûlû genyu. Kûba kabandêlêlo kwabalê!”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Baana babûganga bage baimine kûgya kûsahûla kwana bantû bonse besase bûbê bwababo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yak 5.14</ref></char></note>Ba kumbile minyaga giingê gibê mu bantû, ba handishe batongi baangê no kwê basinga makita.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûkya kwa Yoane Mubatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mt 16.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Malk 8.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lk 9.19</ref></char>
    </note>Noge Kolo Helode ûtegelele musahû gwa Yesû, kibalo sina lyage libele limanyikane kokonse. Bantû bamo besambile: “Yoano mubatisha wa shûka mu baki! No kwanansho elê no bûkome bwakûlonga byesha bibyo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Baange besambile: “Ni Elia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Baange nobo besambile: “Gûdjû mumoni, nagwe gûlya gûmo wabalya bamoni bakala.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Kyaba Helode lwategelele byonse bisambilwe, wêsambile: “Gûlya Yoano! Wankalile twe, washûka!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Lk 3.19-20</ref></char></note>ûtakêshe bamukwate Yoano, bamukwêke midjololo no bamubêke mukikûtû, ûlongile nansho kibalo kya kûlogesha Helodiya mukasi wa Filipo mukwa nyage, wakwelile. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Kibalo Yoano umulombwele Helode: “Hakiyenene kolê kûba no mukasi wa mulûnda nobe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />No gee gûlya Helodiya ûbele mumubêkêle Yoano nfika, ûkebile ku mwiyagya no hanyonghwene, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />kûwa Helode umutudjukile Yoano, kibalo ûbele muntû mulûmbûlûke no wasitêê, nansho umuempile. Kyaba kyamutegelele Yoano, ûdjembile biiko, noge ûkampilwe yaa kumutegelela.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Mone sigi limo, Helodiya ûmwene kyaba kisoga kya kumwiyagya Yoano. Kolo Helode ûtekishe matekya gange kyaba kya sigi lya ngidjû gya kubyalwa kwage, ûkongile bakûlû bamwalo, no bakûlu ba basilêkale ba bantû banyeme ba Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Hûao nsongwa kasi wa Helodiya ûtwelile musense gya kikwe no ûkindile, umulogeshe Helode amo no balya bagitile. Helode umulombwele gûlya nsongwa kasi: “Nombe kyokyonse kyonokeba, no nene nshankûwe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />No ûgêlêlêle byonka umulapêle: “Kyokyonse kyo shaûnombe nshankwabêle, kyo kûba kiba kya bûkolo bwane.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Gûdjo nsongwa kasi uwimine andje, ûgêle kwe nyage no kumubûsha: “Nombe kêê?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Nyage umuendwele: “Lomba twee lya Yoano Mubatisha.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Lûkwe lûmo gûlya nsongwa kasi wêbwêlêle bûkêle kwê Helode no umulombile: “Nankeba onkaano mpebwe twe lya Yoano Mubatisha mulûbadje!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Helode ûkolelwe biiko, mone wandilwe kûbenga kibalo ûlapile kûmeso ga balya bagitile. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Onka alya Helode umutakêshe gûmo wa basilêkale bage kumuêla twe lya Yoano Mubatisha. Musilêkale ûgêle munda gya kikûtû, kumudjêgûla Yoano twe; <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />usilishe twe lya Yoano Mubatisha mulûbadje kumuela gûlya nsongwa kasi, noge nsongwa kasi umuelêle nyage. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Baana babûganga ba Yoano lwabategelele mwanda gûgo, bagêle kutwala mubele gwage, no kwêgûshêka mukilêbû.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walêsha bantû elufu litano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoano 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Kûwa baana babûganga abebwêlêle babûngakene kwê Yesû, bamuêlêle musahû gwa mianda gyonse gyabalongile no gilya gya balangile. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Nansilya kûbele bantû baangê babele basha no bakûgya no hakûbele antû hakûlêla. Yesû wêbalombwele: “Tûbagale kuntû kusi bantû twêtûshe kûko asho.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Nfulo, babandile mubwato bûgima bwabo no kûgyata hantû hasibele bantû.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Mone bantû baangê bebamwene basindûka, basingûlwêle kwabalê mukûgya; nobo bebatangêlêle lûbelo lwa magûlû kuima mubibûndê byabo batangêle kuika mbelê gya Yesû no baana babûganga bage. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Lûb 27.17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Mub 22.17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Miab 18.16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Esek 34.5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mt 9.36</ref></char></note>Abatukile mubwato, Yesû ûmwene mulongo gûkata gwa bantû, wêbamwenene lûsa, kibalo babele amo nagwe mikoko gisi no muempi, Yesû ûbambile kwêbalanga mianda giingê. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Aliikile lêngolo, bana babûganga bamugêlêle Yesû no kumulombola: “Anohatûle mukabenga, no djûba lyawa lwendo. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Wêbalage bantû baba bagyate mumabala no mubibûnde bikûbwêê bole byakûlya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Benywe bene mwibae byakûlya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Nobo bamubulishe: “Twêbûnyonghona kûgya kûûla mikate gya mia gibêlê gya falanga, no kwêbaa kyakûlya?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Noge Yesû wêbabulishe: “Ao mwino mikate gingaa? Mugye bêle mulole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Bagêle kulola no basile kumulombola: “Twêno mikate gitano no misha gibêlê.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Onkao, Yesû ûtakêshe bana babûganga bage bebekêke bonse bibûngo bibûngo, abinya bibêsê. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Nobo bekeene, bibûngo bya bantû lûkama no bya bantu makumi gatano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesû ûtwalile gilya mikate gitano no gilya misha gibêlê, ûlwele meso mwigûlû, no kumufwisha Kabesha Mpûngû. Yesû ûtimwine gilya mikate wêbaele baana babuganga bage bebatange bantû bonse. Kûwa ûtwalile gilya misha gibêle bebatange byonka bantû. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Bonse balêle no kwekûta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Kûwa baana babûganga babungile biende bisigele bya mikate no bya misha badjulishe bitala kumi no bibêlê. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Balya balêle mikate babele baana balûme elufu litano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû watamba egûlû lya madjê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoano 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Onkalya Yesû wêbatakeshe baana babûganga bage batwele mubwato batangele kû Betesaida, kûbwala bwa siba lya Galilaya, noge bugima bwage ûbambile kwêbwêlêsha bantû. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Kûwa Yesû kwêbebwêlêsha balya bantû, ûgêle kûlûgûlû kûlomba. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Aliikile lêngolo, bwato bûbele mubûkata bwa siba, Yesû ûbele bugima bwage kûntala. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Wêbamwene baana babûganga bage bakûdjemba kwa kwekanka no nkaêê, kibalo kya munyaga gusikukile; no kwebakankasha. Akûkendûlûka kwa bûsigi, bamumwene Yesû wakutamba egûlûlû lya madje, no ûkebile kwebaêta. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Kyaba kya bamumwene watamba egûlû lya madje, baningile kwana mulêndê, batele kahûndû, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />bonse bamumwene no batudjukile biiko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Onkao Yesû wêbalombwele: “Mwihe mutema, ninene. Namukatudjuki!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Kûwa Yesû ûbandile mubwato mwababele, munyaga gûtalele. Bonse begalagenie mumitema gyabo. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Nobo habasingûlwele byesha bya gilya mikate; kibalo kya lûûma lwa mitema gyabo.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa handya batongi kûko Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayo 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Yesû no bana babûganga bage, lwabadjabukile bwala bwa siba baikile mwalo gwa Genesaleti, bashaminie nshamo. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Lwa baimine mu bwato, lwendo lûmo bantû ba musingûlwêle Yesû. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Balya bantû bagêle lûbelo kû mwalo gonse no ku bibûndê ba twalile batongi ku mikabo, kwê balonda konse kwa bategelele kwana Yesû wê kûko. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />No hantû onse Yesû agêle, mu tûbûndê, mu bibûndê, no mu mabala, bantû ba bikile batongi ebûlû, no ba mwisasile ebaleke bakume hêndo lya lûbega lwege. No bonse ba mukumine ba handile.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Milango gya Batata nkûlû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayo 15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bafalisayo no bamo balangi babisila bahimine Yelusalema ba bûngakene mbelê gya Yesû. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Ba mwene kwana bange mu bûkata bwa baana babûganga ba Yesû, ba kûlya kya kûlya hakoga kû maboko.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Bafalisayo no Bayuda bonse, ha banyonghoni kûlya kûbûla kooga kû maboko bisoga. Kibalo balamine bisila bya ba tambwêle kû batata nkûlû babo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Kyaba bokuima kwêbûlû, habanyonghoni kûlya ntêê abemunkye kwa madjê. Kûbele binge bisila bya babele balame kuima kû batata nkûlû, nagwe nansilya kukila mpênde, bifulia no ngeso gya mikûba.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Nfulo, balya Bafalisayo no balangi babisila bamubulishe Yesû: “Kibalo kyakê baana babûganga bobe habakokele mugêlêle milango gya batata nkûlû, bakûlya kyakûlya kûmaboko tamatama?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isay 29.13</ref> </char>
    </note>Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Isaya ûbele no sitêê kyaba kyalagwêle kibalo kyenyu, benywe beno nfika, nagwe nansilya byabisintilwe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Kabesha Mpûngû wêsambile, bantû bano bakûnyemeka kwa milomo yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">Mone mitêma gyabo gikûla no nene.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Nobo bakûntota sile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Bakûsahûla milango</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Gilagilwe no bantû!’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Mwabêka bisila bya Kabesha Mpûngû ankondo kibalo mulonde milango gya bantû.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Wêsambile nabo byonka: “Mwakûbenga bisila bya Kabesha Mpûngû no mwalonda milango gya batata nkûlû. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kuim 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21.17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 20:9">Nghib 20.9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Ngib 5.16</ref></char></note>Kibalo Musa wêsambile, ‘Wêbanyemeke bashobe no nyobe,’ no, ‘Gûlya wêkata mulago shage ao nyage muyenene kûkya.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Mone benywe, mwakûlanga kwana: ‘Ntêê muntû gûmo kwêsamba kwê shage ao nyage: kilya kyanamba nankeba kûkûkwasha shanikiimie nagwe mulambû kwê Kabesha Mpûngû, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />akino kyokyonse kyakûmukwasha shage no nyage, no mwamutakêsha alonge nansho.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Nansilya bya mulê mukûbedja mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, kibalo kya mianda gya muwêle kûtambûla kûbatata nkûlû, byonka mwakûlonga mianda ginge gingê gigûlange no gigyo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mianda gya kumulonga muntû bûbê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayo 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Nfulo Yesû witile byonka kikyo kibûngo no kwêkilombola kwana, “Muntegelele, benywe bonse, no musingûlûle mianda gino. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Hakûle kintû kya andje kyakumutwela muntû munda kimulonge abe no bûbê, mone mianda gya kuima munda gya muntû ûgyakumulonga kûba no bûbê.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />[Muntû gûlya wêno matwê gakûtegelela no ategelele.]<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Kyaba Yesû lwesigene no kibûngo no kûtwela munda gya nsese, baana babûganga bage bamubulishe nsintwe gya gilya nkêndê. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Wêbalombwele: “No bene benywe hamwakusingûlûla? Hamwibamanye kwana kintû kya kumutwela muntû munda hakimulongi bûbê mone kyakuima munda ûkyakumulonga muntû bûbê, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />kibalo bintû bibyo habimutweli mu mutêma, nambo munda, no nghimba byakuima mumubêle gwage no kûtebwa kioloni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kabine ka kuninina</char></note>” kwanansho, Yesû umukinshe bilêbwa byonse.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesû ûgêlêlêle kwêsamba: “Kyakuima munda gya muntû ûkya kumulonga bûbê. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kibalo munda gya mitema gya bantû, mwakuima maninga gabê, bûseki, lwêbo, no bûngyagani, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />kosikosi, bwêma, bûbê; bûbembani, bûkosoke, bûkwa, malûmbû, kahûni no bûbidje. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Bibyo byonse bibê ûbyakuima munda gya muntû nobyo ûbyakumulonga muntû bûbê.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwanamukasi mugeni wamwitabêsha Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayo 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Kûwa, Yesû ûsemukile kûko ûgêle lwege kûmwalo gwa Tilo. Ûtwelile mu nsese gimo hakampilwe muntû kûmanya kwana wêmulya, no wandilwe kwibisêka. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ao abele mwana mukasi gûmo, ûbele no nsongwa kasi wage ûbele no munyaga gûbe, lwategelele musahû gwa Yesû lûkwe lûmo gûlya madjû usile kûgwêla kûmagûlû gage. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mwana mukasi gûlya ûbele Mugiliki, ûbele mbyalwa wansê gya Suliya. Gee umulombile Yesû akûmbe gûlya munyaga gûbe guime munda gya nsongwa kasi wage. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Mone Yesû umuêndwêle: “Lekela bêle baana bamunsese balye bekûte, hakiyenene kûtwala bilêbwa bya baana kûtela mikelekese.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />“Mwana mukasi,” gûlya umuêndwêle: “Kolo, ni sitêê, mone nogine mikelekese gikûtola bilya bikûgwêsha baana ansê gya mutalako!”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Nfulo Yesû umulombwele mwana mukasi, “Kibalo kya mianda gyonolisamba, wêbûnyonghona kwêbwêlêla kû nsese gyobe, munyaga gwaima munda gya nsongwa kasi obe!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Kyaba kyagibwêlêle kû nsese gyage, ûsangene mwana mulale kûbûtanda; no munyaga gûbê gwawa kumuima.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandya kameme mpokoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesû uimine byonka kûmwalo gwa Tilo, uitile ku Sidona, ûgêle kwisiba lya Galilaya, kwêtêla mu mwalo gwa bibûndû kumi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapoli</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Bamuêlêle muntû gûmo ûsha kwêsamba no kûtegelela, bamulombile no kumwisasa amutenteke kûboko egûlû lyage. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Onkao Yesû umwitolishe gûdjo muntû no kibûngo, wêtolile nage asho, ûtwelishe minie mu matwe gage, kûwa ukumine lulimi lwege no minie gitome mataa gage. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesû ûlwele mwigûlû, ûhemwine no kwê samba: “Efata,” nsintwe kwage, “Sikûka!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Lûkwe lûmo matwê gage gasikukile, no lûlimi lusikukile ûbambile kwêsamba bisoga. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesû wêbalagêlêle nabakalomboli muntû, monka mwelibakandêle, mone boo bagêlêlêle kûtûmbya musahû. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Bantû begalagenie biiko no kûbamba kwêsamba: “Walonga bilongwa byonse gisoga, wanyonghonia mpokoto kûtegelela no kameme kwêsamba!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû walêsha bantû elufu lina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayo 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mu masigi gago, kûbele kibûngo kikata kya bantû kibûngakene byonka. No hababele no kya kûlya. Yesû wêbetile bana babûganga bage no kwêbalombola: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nanibamwena lûsa bantû bano, kibalo nangikana nabo ano masigi gano gasatû, no habalê kyakûlya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ntêê nene kwêbaleka bagye kûmasese gabo, balê nondjala shabaûngêle mundjêla, kibalo bange nabo baima kûla.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Baana babûngaga bage bamuêndwêle: “Muno mukabenga muntû wêbûmona kwêê kyakûlya kya kwêbekûtya?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesû wêbabulishe: “Mwino mikate ginga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Besambile: “Kiloba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Nfulo ûtakêshe kibûngo kwêkana ansê. Kûwa ûtwalile mikate kiloba, no lwewêle kufwisha Kabesha Mpûngû, wigitimwine, no kwêbaha baana babûganga bebatange bantû; nobo balongile nansho. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Babele byonka no tûmisha tûnge tûketûke. Yesû umufwilishe Kabesha Mpûngû no kwêbalombola baana babûganga batange byonka nansho. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8-9" />Bonse balêle no kwêkûta kûwa baana babûganga batolile biêndê bisigele bidjûlile tûtambala kiloba. No bantû balêle baningêlêlwe kûba elufu lina. Kûwa wêbebwêlêshe. <verse eid="MRK 8:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Lwendo lûmo, Yesû ûbandile munda gya bwato amo no baana babûganga bage, ûgêle mumwalo gwa Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafalisayo bakebile byesha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12.38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mt 12.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Lk 11.16</ref></char>
    </note>Bafalisayo basile no kûbamba kûwakanania no Yesû. No kwakumutompa, bamulombile amonie kabandêlêlo kuima mwigûlû. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mt 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Lk 11.29</ref></char></note>Yesû hûûngêle biiko mumutêma gwage, wêsambile: “Kibalo kyakêê lûbyalo lûlû lwakûkeba kabandêlêlo? Sitêê nanimilombola, lûbyalo lûlû halûkaêbwa kabandêlêlo kokonse.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Kûwa Yesû wêbasigile, ûbandile mubwato, wêbwêlêle bwala bwa siba.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kidjûsho kya Bafalisayo no Helode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayo 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Baana babûganga bage babele bebêlêle kûtwala mikate, hababele no kintû nambo mukate gûmolo mubwato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Lk 12.1</ref></char></note>Yesû wêbatakêshe kwana: “Mube meso no kidjûsho, Kya Bafalisayo no kidjûsho kya Helode.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Baana babûganga bage besongenie bobene: “Kibalo hababele no mikate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesû ûsingûlwele mianda gya besongenie, wêbabulishe: “Kibalo kyakêê mwakwêsongenia kwana mwinghe mikate? Hamwalimanye byonka no hamwalisingûlûle? Kuana mitêma gyenyû gibusito? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Yelem 5.21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Esek 12.2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Malk 4.12</ref></char></note>Mwino meso no hamwakumona? Mwino matwê no hamwakûtegelela? No hamwakwêdjûkana, <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />antimwine gilya mikate gitano no kwêbaha balya elufu litano? Mutwalile mitûngû ginga gidjule biêndê bya mikate?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">“Bamuendwele,” kumi no gibêlê.<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Yesû wêbabulishe byonka,” kyaba kyantimwine gilya mikate kiloba, “no kûlêsha bantû elefu lina, mutwalile tûtambala tûûnga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">“Bamuêndwele,” Kiloba.<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Nfulo Yesû wêbabulishe: “Noene ano hamwalisingûlûle?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wamuhandya mpoki wa Betesaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesû no baana babûganga bage baikile Betesaida, bamuêlêle muntû gûmo mpoki, bamulombile no kumwisasa amukume. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Umukwatile mpoki kûkûboko no kumuimya andje gya kibûndê. Kûwa umusingile mata kû meso gage, no kumutenteka kûboko, no kumubûsha: “Wamona kintû kimo?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Mpoki ûlwele wê sambile: “Namona bantû benagwe mitê gya kûtamba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesû ûtentekile maboko gage byonka kûmeso ga mpoki. Noge ûmwene bisoga, abele poo, ûmwene byonse hûtû hûtû. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Kûwa Yesû umwibwêleshe no kumulombola: “Nokebwilili byonka mukibûndê.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wasitêkêkya kwana Yesû û Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayo 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesû no baana babûganga bage bagêle mubibûndê bya Kaisalia Filipo. Lwababele mundjêla wêbabulishe: “Bantû bakwêsamba nene nini?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Malk 6.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Lk 9.7-8</ref></char>
    </note> “Nobo bamuêndwêle bamo bakwêsamba kwana wê Yoano Mubatisha,” bange bakwêsamba; “kwana wê Elia, no bange bakwêsamba kwana wê gûmo wabamoni.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Yoa 6.68-69</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Yesû wêbabulishe?” no benywe mwalisamba. “Kuana nene nini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petelo umuêndwêle, “Gwee ûge Kilisitu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesû wêbalagêlêle namukamulomboli muntû mianda gino.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walagûla kibalo kya luki lwege</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayo 16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Kûwa Yesû ubambile kwêbalanga baana babûganga bage: “Kimuyenene Mwana wa muntû andjembibwe biiko, kûbengwa no batata nkûlû, no bakûlû ba balambwili, no balangi ba bisila. No kwêyagwa, no nghimba gya masigi gasatû wêkashûka.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Lwalibalombwele mwanda gûgo hûtû hûtû. Petelo umuitile Yesû kûkondo no kûbamba kumukanda nokesambi nansho. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Mone Yesû wêbalabûkêle, wêbalwele baana babûganga bage, no umukankêle Petelo wêsambile: “Sindûka kûla nane Satana, maninga gobe haga Kabesha Mpûngû nambo ga bantû.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lk 14.27</ref></char>
    </note>Kûwa Yesû witile kibûngo no baana babûganga bage, wêbalombwele: “Muntû gense wakûkeba kûnonda nene, ebenge gemwine, etenteke mutê gwa mpênga mpetya gwage, anonde. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lk 17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoa 12.25</ref></char></note>Kwakûba muntû wakûkeba kûhandya ngikeno kyage wêkegisiminia, no muntû wêkasiminia ngikeno kyage kibalo kyane no kibalo kya musahû gûsoga wakegihandya. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Katolwa kêê kwa muntû kûba no bûheta bonse bwa kandje, noge asiminie bûkome bwage? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Kikêê muntû kyalêbuimia kwa kûhandya bûkome bwage? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ntêê muntû gee kûtegelela nsoni kibalo kyane no mianda gyane, mbelê gya bantû bano balûbyalo lûlû, lusi lumukokele Kabesha Mpûngû, no bantomboki; Mwana wa muntû wêkamumwena nsoni muntû gûdjo, kikaba nansho lwenekasha mu ntûmbo gya Shage amo no masalagûlû galûmbûlûke.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesû wêbalombwele byonka: “Sitêê nanimilombola, mubûkata bwa bano beano kwêbamo habakantompi luki ntêê abalimone Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwakûsha kwa bûkome.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wakenka lûkebo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayo 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Pet 1.17-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nghimba gya masigi mutanda, Yesû ûtwalile Petelo, Shake,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> no Yoano, ûgêle nabo kûlûgûlû lûla bugima bwabo. Kûko ûkenkile lûkebo lwege kûgêbwa kwabo, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />bishandê byage bikenkile no bibele bimunke biiko, bisinyonghoni mufuli wa kandje kwibimunkya nansilya byabibele. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ûao baana babûganga basatu bamwene Elia amo no Musa bakûbanga no Yesû. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Nfulo Petelo umulombwele Yesû: “Mulangi, kisoga betwe kûba ano! No tûlongye bitanda bisatû, kimo kyobe, kimo kya Musa, no kinge kya Elia.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Kibalo hamanyine kya kwêsamba, mwanda boonse batwelilwe no kyobi kiingê.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Malk 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3.22</ref></char>
    </note>Nfulo kile kisile kwêbaûta no bûlelo bwage, djûê liimine mu kilya kile: “Gûdjû ûmwanane wandê mukampwe mumutegelele gee!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Lûkwe lûmo, baana babûganga bage balwele kûkû no kûkû; habamwene muntû gûnge, nambo Yesû bugima bwage amonobo.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />No lwababele batûka kûlûgûlû, Yesû wêbakandile kwana: “Naba kalomboli muntû gegense mianda gyabamwene, kuikêla Mwana wa muntû ene kashûka kuima kûbaki.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Nobo bakwatêshe milago gigyo, mone babambile kwêbûsenia bobene kwa bobene: “Kûko kûshûka mubaki kwêno nsintwe kêê?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:5">Malk 4.5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mt 11.14</ref></char></note>Bamubulishe Yesû banine: “Kibalo kyakêê balangi babisila bakwêsamba kwana kiyenene Elia ashebêlê?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Nisitêê, Elia muyenene kûshabêle, no kûbadjambûla bintû byonse. Kibalo kyakêê kisintilwe kwana Mwana wa muntû wêkasûsûlwa no kûbedjwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Mone nanimilombola kwana, Elia wawakûsha, no bantû bamulongele byonse byababele bakampwe, nagwe nansilya bisintilwe kibalo kyage.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandya mwana wêno minyaga gibê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Matayo 17.14-20</ref>; Luka 9.37-43a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />No lwabaikile bange baana babûganga, bamwene kibûngo kikata kya bantû kibalagale no balangi babisila bakwakanania nabo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Lûkwe lûmo, kibûngo kyonse akimumwene Yesû, kigalagenie biiko, kimugêlêle lûbelo kumwimuna. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesû wêbabulishe baana babûganga bage: “Mwakwêakanenia nabo kibalo kya kêê?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Muntû gûmo mukibûngo umuêndwêle: “Mulangi, namusisha mwanane kolê, wakûdjembibwa no minyaga gibê no gyakumusibêla kwêsamba. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />No kyaba kyonse gilya minyaga gya kumutubigania no kumuta ansê, noge wakuimwa no fuluu, nokwêhela meno, no kuumibwa. Nibalombile baana babûganga bobe bamuimie gilya minyaga gibê mone habanyonghwene.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesû wêbalombwele: “Benywe bantû balûbyalo lusi no lwêtabêsho! Kuikêla kyaba kêê kyandê kaba nenyu? Kuikêla kyaba kêê kyandê kemilêndêla? Mumusishe gûdjo nsongwa lûme ano andê!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Nobo bamwilile gûlya mwana kwê Yesû.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">No lwendo lûmo, gûlya mwana lwamumwene Yesû, gilya minyanga gibê gimudjugumbishe gûlya nsongwa lûme gumutele ansê, no mwana ûbambile kwêgalamuna galamuna, no kuimimwa no fuluu. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesû umubulishe shage wa mwana, “Emulû! Bino bimubambile kyaba kêê? Shage umuêndwêle.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">“Ubambile kûlongeka nansino kûbambêla bwanike bwage.” <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />“No makwe gangê minyaga gya kumugwêsha mukaya no mumadjê, kibalo gimutobeshe. Ntêê wêbûnyonghona kûlonga kintû, wêtûkyêle lûsa no kwêtûkwasha!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesû umuêndwêle walisamba kêê, “Kuana wêbûnyonghona! Byonse byanyonghokela kwa gûlya wakwêtabêsha.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Lwendo lûmo, shage no gûlya nsongwa lûme ûtele kahundû wêsambile: “Nangitabêsha, mone lwêtabêsho lwane alûgwane, nkwashe kwakûbûla kwêtabêsha kwane!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Noge Yesû lwamwene kûba kibûngo kyabûngakana bûkêlê, wêgikankêle minyaga gibêê. Wenine: “Ginywee minyaga gya bûmeme no gyampokoto, nene namitakêsha mumuime gûdjo nsongwa lûme namukamutweli byonka!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Gilya minyaga gibûlwêle, no gimudjugumbishe gûndjo musongwa lûme byonka, no gimwimine. Gûdjo nsogwalûme umonekile nagwe mukye, no bange besambile: “Wakya!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Mone Yesû umukwatile kûkûboko umwimikile, noge wêmene.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Kyaba Yesû kyatwelile mu nsese, baana babûganga bage bamubulishe kûkondo: “Kibalo kyakêê betwe atwêbanyonghone kuimia gilya minyaga gibê?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle kwana: “Minyaga bigigi haginyonghokeli kuima, nambo, kwa kûlomba.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walisamba byonka kibalo kya luki lwage</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesû no baana babûganga bage baimine ao no kûkalûlûla kibûndê kya Galilaya. Noge Yesû hakebile muntû kûmanya antû abele, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Lola, byebalangile baana babûganga bage, wêbalombwele: “Mwana wa Muntû wagya kûbêkwa mu maboko ga bantû. Nobo beka mwiyaga, nghimba gya masigi gasatû, wakashûka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Mone baana babûganga bage habegusingûlwêle gûlya mwanda, batudjukile kumubûsha.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani muyenene mubûkata bwetû?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Kyaba Yesû no baana babûganga bage lwabaikile Kapelenaumu, wêbabulishe: “Mubele mwaliakanenia mwanda kêê mundjêla?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lk 22.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mone batalele, mwanda mundjêla beakanenie kwana nani muyenene mubûkata bwabo. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26-27">Mt 20.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43-44">Malk 10.43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lk 22.26</ref></char></note>Nfulo Yesû wêkene, wêbetile balya kumi no babêlê no kwêbalombola: “Muntû wakûkeba kûba mutangi kûbonse, muyenene kûba wanfulo kubonse no kûba mwingili wabonse.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Ûtwalile mwana wakitûtû no kumwimika abûkata bwabo. Umukumbatêle no kwêbalombola: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lk 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoa 13.20</ref></char></note>“Muntû kûtambûla mwana gûmo wamuswelo gûgû kusina lyane, wantambûla nene; no muntû wakankûnka nene, hamunkûnke nene ya naambo gûlya untumine.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usimangi gyenyu wêmugela gwenyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yoano umulombwele Yesû: “Mulangi, tûmwene muntû gûmo ukumbile minyaga gibê musina lyobe, no betwe tumukandile, kibalo gee hagûmo netû.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “Namukamukandi, kibalo hakûle muntû wêkalonga byesha kusina lyane no kûnyonghona lwendo lûmo kunisambêla mabêhe.” <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mt 12.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Lk 11.23</ref></char></note>Kibalo ûshakwakanania netû, wêmugela gwetû. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mt 10.42</ref></char></note>Sitêê nanimilombola, kwakûba gegense wêkemia madjê gakwêkûbêla, kibalo benywe mwi bantû ba Kilisitu, muntû gûdjo hekabûla kûebwa katolwa kage.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bikukasi bya kûgwêsha bantû mubûbê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayo 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Gûlya wêkagwêsha mwana gûmo mubûbê gûlya mungitabêshe, muyenene akwêkwe bwee likata munkingo gyage no kûtebwa mwisiba.” <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mt 5.30</ref></char></note>Ntêê kibalo kya kûboko kobe kwakûgwêsha mubûbê, wêkûkale! Kiyenene kole kûtwela mu bûkome walê no kûboko kûmo, kûbûla kûba no maboko gabêlê, no kûtebwa mulûbêmbê lwakaya kasikusimika. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[Kuana mumo mwi byolo bisi kûkya, no kaya kasikusimika.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Ntêê kibalo kya kûgûlû kobe kwakûgwêsha mubûbê, wêkûkale! Kiyenene kole kûtwela mu bûkome walê no kûgûlû kûmo, kûbûla kûba no magûlû gabêlê, no kûtebwa mulûbêmbê lwakaya kasikusimika. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[Kuana mumo mwi byolo bisi kûkya, no kaya kasikusimika.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mt 5.29</ref></char></note>Ntêê kibalo liiso lyobe lyakûgwêsha mubûbê, wilitukune! Kiyenene kolê kûtwela mu Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû walê no liiso limo, kûbûla kûba no meeso gabêlê, no kûtebwa mulûbêmbê lwakaya kasikusimika. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Isay 66.24</ref></char></note>Kuana mumo mwi byolo bisi kûkya, no kaya kasikusimika.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Lûkwe lûmo muntû gense wêkabêkwa mukele kûkaya.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mt 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Lk 14.34-35</ref></char>
    </note>Mukele kintû kisoga; mone ntêê mukele gwa siminia ntobo gyage, shamubêke kêê gûbe ntobo byonka?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Mube no mukele munda gyenyu, mukekane angalê benywe kwa benywe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Malenge kibalo kya kûlekenkana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayo 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesû ûsemukile kûko, kuika kûmwalo gwa Bayuda, bwala bwa Yolodani. Kibûngo kibûngakene no ûbambile kûsahûla, bibele kidjibisi kyage.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Nfulo Bafalisayo bamo bamugêlêle kwa kumutompa no bamubulishe wêtûlombole: “Bisila byetû bitakêshe mulûme kûkûmba mukasha gêê?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle kwa bûsho lili: “Musa wêmilagêlêle kêê?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Ngib 24.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mt 5.31</ref></char>
    </note>Besambile: “Musa ûtakêshe kwê mulûme kusinta lûpapûlo lwa kûkûmba mukasi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesû wêbalombwele: “Kibalo kya mitema gyenyu gibumu Musa wemisintêle bisila bibyo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Mub 1.27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5.2</ref></char></note>Mone mubambo gwa Kûhangwa kandje: Kabesha Mpûngûkwa hûhangile mwana mulûme no mwana mukasi, nagwe lusinto byalûle lwêsambe. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Mub 2.24</ref></char></note>‘Akibalo kikyo, muntû wakasiga shage no nyage no bekalaminkana no mukashage, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />no babo babêlê bekaba mubêlê gumo.’ Habakabi byonka babêlê, nambo mubêle gûmo. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Nfulo kikuminkenie Kabesha Mpûngû, muntû nekasi kûlekenkania.<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Kyaba kya bebwêlêle mu nsese, baana babûganga bage bamubulishe byonka kibalo kya mwanda gûlya. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mt 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Bakl 7.10-11</ref></char></note>Yesû wêbaêndwêle, “Muntû gense wakamuleka mukashage no kûkwela gûnge walonga bûseki mbelê gya mukasi mutangi. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Byonka nansilya, no mukasi kumutêna mulûme wage no kûkwelwa no mulûme gûnge walonga bûseki.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walibesela malyese baana bakitûtû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bantû bamo bamuêlêle Yesû baana bakitûtû kibalo ebatenteke maboko, mone baana babûganga bage bebakankêle. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />No Yesû lwamwene nansho, ûkolelwe biiko no wêbalombwele: “Mwibalekele baana bakitûtû bashe kwandê, namukebasibili, kibalo Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû bwa bantû benagwe bano baana. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mt 18.3</ref></char></note>Nanimilombola sitêê, ntêê muntû usimutambûle Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû nagwe mwana wakitûtû hakatweli mbeela.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Nfulo, wêbakûmbatêle baana balya, wêbatentekile maboko gage kûmatwe gabo, wêbesele malyese.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû no mpeta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Kyaba Yesû kyegêlêlêle no lwendo lwege, muntû gûmo usile lûbêlo no kukutama kûgêbwa kwage, no kumubûsha: “Mulangi musoga, nonge ntêê mone kûbêkala bûkome bwa milembambagala?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />“Yesû umulombwele mwanda gwa kêê wangita musoga?” Hakûle muntû musoga. “Nambo Kabesha Mpûngû bugima bwage. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kuim 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Ngib 5.16-20</ref></char></note>Wêmumanye bisila bibyo: ‘No keyagi; no kalongi bûseki; no keebi; no kasitêkêkya buumpi kwa muntû; no katwali kintû kwa muntû kwa kumubemba, wêbanyemeke ba shobe no nyobe.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />“Gûlya muntû umuêndwêle Mulangi,” bibi byonse nimwibikwatêshe, “kûbambêla bwanike bwane.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesû umulwele no kumukampwa biiko umulombwele, “Wêmutaûkêlwe no kintû kimo yaa. Gyata ûshe byonse byolê nabyo no wêbahe balanda, nogwe shaûbe no bûkûsa mwigûlû; kûwa gibwêlêla ûnonde.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Mone gûlya muntû lwategelele mwanda gûlya, ûgêle walê mukolelwe biiko, kibalo ûbele mpeta.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesû ûlwele kokonse, wêbalombwele baana babûganga bage: “Kibumu kwa mpeta kûtwela mubûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Baana babûganga begalagenie no mianda gyage, wêbalombwele byonka: “Benywe baana bane, kilûma biiko kûtwela mubûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Kiele ngamia kûûlûka mwilolo lya lusinge, kûlêmba mpeta kûtwela mubûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Baana babûganga bage, lwabategelele mianda gigyo, begalagenie biiko kwanansho bebûsenie bobene: “Nani wêbûnyonghona kûhanda?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesû wêbalwele no wêbalombwele: “Kûbantû hakinyonghokeli, mone kwê Kabesha Mpûngû byonse byanyonghokela.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Kûwa Petelo umulombwele: “Lola, betwe twasiga byonse no kûkûlonda gwee.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesû wêndwêle “Sitêê,” Namilombola, muntû gegense wêkasiga nsese gyage, “no mwanabo mwana mulûme ao mwanabo mwana mukasi ao nyage ao shage ao baana, ao mabala kibalo kyane no musahû gûsoga, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />wêkaebwa nghendo mia kyaba kino: wakatambûla nsese, no ba mwanabo baana balûme, no ba mwanabo baana bakasi, noba nyage no baana no mabala. No bilya byonse wakatambûla kwa masûsû, no kyaba kyakasha bûkome bwa milembambagala. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mt 20.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Lk 13.30</ref></char></note>Mone balya babele batangi, bekaba ba nfulo, no balya babele banfulo bekaba batangi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walisamba lûkwe lwa bûsatû kibalo kya kûkya no kûsangûka kwage</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesû no baana babûganga bage kyaba kya babele bagyata Yelusalema, Yesû ûbele kûgêbwa kwabo, baana babûganga babele no kininga mumitêma; no bantû babele bamulonda batwelilwe no kaaga. Nfulo gyage ûtwalile byonka balya kumi no babêlê ûbambile kwêbalombola musahû gwa mianda gika mukuma. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Yesû wêbalombwele, “Mutegelele,” “twagya Yelusalema kûlya Mwana wa Muntû wêkabêkwa mumaboko ga bakûlû ba balambwili no balangi babisila. Nobo bekamukalêla nsambû eyagwe bekamubêka mumaboko gabashantaila. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Nobo bashantaila bekamufutulula, no kumushêlêla mata, no bakamuûla nswii, no kumwiyaga; no nghimba gya masigi gasatû wakashûka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lombi lya shake no Yoane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayo 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Byonka Shake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> no Yohane, baana ba Sebedayo, ba mugêlêle Yesû. “No kumulombola,” “Mulangi, twakeba wetû longele kyokyonse kya tûshatûkûlombe.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesû wê babulishe: “Mwakeba nimilongele kêê?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Nobo bamuêndwêle: “Wê tûtakêshe twêkane, gûmo kûboko kobe kûlûme, no gûnge kûboko kobe kûso kyaba kyolê kasha mu ntumbo gyobe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:50">Lk 12.50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mone Yesû wê balombwele: “Ha mwidjê kya mulê mukûlomba. Mwi bûnyonghona kwê kûbêla lûhêndê lwandê kekûbêla nene? Ao kû batisibwa lûbatisho lwandê kabatisibwa nene?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bamuêndwêle: “Twê bûnyonghona”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesû ûgêlêlêle kwê balombola: “Sitêê mwa kekûbêla lûhêndê lwandê kekûbêla, no mwi kabatisibwa lûbatisho lwandê kabatisibwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Mone nsina bûkome bwa kûbêka muntû kûboko kwane kûlûme ao kûboko kwane kûso. Antû alya abantû Kabesha Mpûngû ebalongele.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />No balya kumi lwa bategelele mianda gigyo, babambile kwê basumininwa ba Shake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> no Yoane. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-26">Lk 22.25-26</ref></char></note>Yesû wê betile bonse no kwê balombola: “Mwi bamanye kwana balya babalwe kûba bakûlû babantû bakwimibêkala kwabumu, no bantû babo banyeme kwê bakomena. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mt 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Malk 9.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lk 22.26</ref></char></note>Mone, nabikabi nansho mu bûkata bwenyu, ntêê muntû gee kûkeba kûba mukûlû kwamulê, no abe mwingili wenyu; <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />no muntû wakeba kûba mutangi kwamulê, no abe mugya wabonse. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kibalo Mwana wa Muntû hamushe kwê ngêlelwa; usile kibalo kya kwê ngêlêlana bantû no kuimia ngikeno gyage kûba alêpe bwikuli bwa bantû bangê.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wahandya mpoki Batolomayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yesû no baana babûganga bage lwa baikile mu kibûndê kya Yeliko, kyaba kya babambile kuima Yeliko, no baana babûganga bage, amo no kibûngo kikata kya bantû. Muntû gûmo mpoki witilwe Batolomayo mwana wa Timayo ûbele mwikane kûnkondo gya ndjêla mu kûlomba lomba. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Noge lwe tegelele kwana ni Yesû Munasaleti wakuêta, ubambile kûta kahûndû no kwêsamba: “Yesû Mwana wa Daudi, nkyêlê lûsa!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bantû bangê bamukankêle kûba atalale. Mone ûgêlêlêle kûta kahûndû wêsambile: “Yesû Mwana wa Daudi, nkyêle lûsa!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesû wêmene no kwêsamba: “Mumwite.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Nfulo bamwitile gûlya mpoki no kumulombola: “Wêhee mutêma! Gimana, wa kwêta.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Kyaba kye tegelele gilya mianda, ûtele kishandê kya mpeho, wêmene ûshenine kûbwêhê no Yesû.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesû umubulishe: “Wakeba nkulongele kêê?” Gûlya mpoki umuêndwêle:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">“Mulangi, nankampwa mone byonka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesû umulombwele: “Bagala lobe, lwêtabêsho lobe lwakûwandia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Lwendo lûmo ûmwene byonka, umulondile Yesû mundjêla.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû watwela Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoano 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Yesû no baana babûganga bage lwa bashenine Yelusalema, kûbwêhê no ka kibûndê ka Betefage no ka Betania, kuikêla kû bwûhê no lûgûlû lwa Mpasi. Wêbatumine babêlê mu balya baana babûganga bage <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />wê balombwele: “Mugyate mu kalya ka kibûndê ke kûgêbwa kwenyu. No kyaba kyamulê kaika mulya, mwikamona mwana mpûnda mu kwêkwe, hûshalibandwe no muntû. Mumusokone mumpêle. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />No ntêê muntû gee kwêmibûsha, kibalo kyakê mwalonga nansho? Mumulombole Kolo wakumukeba no byonka saamwibwêlêshe onkano.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bagêle kûtana mwana mpûnda mu kwêkwe andje ankondo gya mushango gwa sense. Ba musokwene, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />bantû bange babele bemane kûko be babulishe: “Kibalo kya kêê mwakumusokona mwana wa mpûnda?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Nobo baana babûganga bage bebaêndwêle monka Yesû mwelibalagêlêle, nobo bantû balya bebalekele babagale. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bamuêlêle Yesû gûlya mwana wa mpûnda, bandjile bisandê byabo kwêgûlû lyage, no Yesû wêkene egûlû lyage. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bantû bangê bandjile bisandê byabo mundjêla, no bange matabê ga bakalile kûmabala. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Nghib 118.25-26</ref></char></note>Bantû babele kûgêbwa no babele nghimba batele kahûndû besambile: “Hosana! Eselwe malyese gûlya wakûsha musina lya Kolo! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Bwêsêlwe malyese bûkolo bwakûsha ûbo bûkolo bwa shetû Daudi, hosana! Ntûmbo kwê Kabesha Mpûngû wi mwigûlû!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesû ûtwelile Yelusalema, no kûgya mukitotelo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekaluni</char></note> no ebidjile kûlola bintû byonse mugela gonse. Alishabele nghimba usemukile kûgya Betania amo no balya kumi no babêlê.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wata mulago kikûdjû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayo 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />No lukindwe, lwege Yesû no baana babûganga bage baimine Betania. Ûtegelele ndjala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ûmwene kwakûla mutê gwa kikûdjû gwêno mani gangê, nfulo ûgêle kûlola ange wêbumona bihelo kumutê gûlya. Mone aikile kubwêê no gûlya mutê, hamwene kintû nambo mani yaa, kibalo hakibele kyaba kyage kya kûa bihelo. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Kûwa Yesû wêsambile gûlya mutê: “Kûbamba lêno muntû hakali byonka bihelo byobe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Baana babûganga bage bategelele mwanda gûgo gwalisambile.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wakûmba basûlû mu kitotelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoano 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Yesû no baana babûganga bage lwabaikile Yelusalema, noge utwelile munda gya kisakye kya kitotelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekalu</char></note> ûbambile kwêbakûmba bantû balya babele bagûsha no kûûla bintû byabo munda gya kisakye kya kitotelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekalu</char></note>. Walabwêle mitalako gya basintya ba lûheto no bikoma byabo bya babele bagûsha nkûnda. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />No hatakêshe muntû kûtwala kintû munda gya kisakye kya kitotelo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekaluni</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isay 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yelem 7.11</ref></char></note>Yesû ûbambile kwêbalanga no kwêbalombola: “Kisintwe mulûsinto lûlûmbûlûke: ‘Nsese gyane giketwa nsese gya milombelo kumiso gyonse.’ Mone benywe mwalikilonga kûba kisakyê kya baswinania!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Bakûlû ba balambwili no balangi babisila lwabategelele musahû gûgo, bakebile bûlûle bwa kumutobesha Yesû. Mone bamutudjukile, kibalo kibûngo kyonse kigalagenie kwa milango gyage.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Akiikile kyaba kyalêngolo, Yesû no baana babûganga bage baimine andje gya kibûndê.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Milango kibalo kya kikûdjû kihumbile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayo 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Lukindwe lwege, kyaba Yesû no baana babûganga bage babele bahêta mundjêla, bamwene gûlya mutê gwa kikûdjû gwa kûhûmba. Kûbambêla kûmatabê kwikêla kumisi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petelo wêdjûkene gilya mianda giitile, kûwa umulombwele Yesû: “Mulangi, lola, kikûdjû kyotele mulago gyahûmba!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Kûwa Yesû wêbalombwele bana babûganga bage: “Mube no lwetabêsho kwê Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mt 17.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Bakl 13.2</ref></char></note>Sitêê nanimilombola, muntû gense wêkalombola lûgûlû lûlû kwana: Tekuka ûkete mwisiba no ntêê wenghe kaaga mumutêma gwage, mone wagitabêsha kwana bibyo byalê kesamba bikalongeka sitêê. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kibalo kikyo namilombola, kyo kyonse kyamulê kalomba mumilombelo gyenyu, mwitabêshe kwana muwêle kûtambûla, no mwikamona. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14-15">Mt 6.14-15</ref></char></note>No kyaba kyamulê beemane kûlomba, ntêê wêno mwanda no muntû mulekelele, kibalo Tata wenyu wamwigûlû wêkemilekelela byonka nansho no benywe bûbê bwenyu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Mone ntêê hamwiba lekelele bange, no Tata wenyu wêmwigûlû hemilekeleli benywe bûbê bwenyu byonka nansilya.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wabusibwa kibalo kya kitenta kyage</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesû no baana babûganga bage baikile Yelusalema byonka. Yesû lwabele mukûtamba mukisakye kya kitotelo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekaluni</char></note> bakûlû ba balambwili, balangi babisila, no batata nkûlû , bamuikêle Yesû <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />bamubulishe: “Kwa kitenta kêê kyonokûlonga mianda gino? Noge nani ûkûele kitenta kino?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle: “No nene shanimibûshe bûûsho limo, ntêê mwampêndûla, no nene byonka nansho shanimilombole kwa kitenta kêê kya nankûlonga mianda gino. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Munombole, Yoano ûmwene kitenta kyakûbatisha kuima kwinii: Kwê Kabesha Mpûngû ao kû bantû?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Kûwa besongenie bo bene kwabo bene besambile: “Ntêê betwe kuêndûla, kwana kitenta kyage kiimine kwê Kabesha Mpûngû”, shaetûbûshe: “Mwanda gwa kêê hamwibamwitabêshe?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Mone betwe kwêsamba kwana: “Kiimine kûbantû.” Batudjukile bantû, kibalo bantû bonse betabêshe Yoano kûba mumoni wasitê. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Kûwa bamuêndwêle Yesû: “Hatwêdje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yesû wêbalombwele: “No mwine nene nsimilomboli benywe, kwa kitenta kêê kyandê mukûlonga bino.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa bengili babê babala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Isay 5.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yesû ûbambile kwêsamba no bakûlû babalambwili kwa nkêndê: Muntû gûmo ukunine bala lya misabibu, no kwilisakêlêla, no ûlongishe muaba gwa kûbengwêla mo difai, uhimpile kilêngo kya baempi. Ubikile balimi no ûgêle kûnsêê gya kûla. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Kyaba kya kwêmbûla akiikile, utumine mwingili kûbalya balimi mwanda atambûle biimbûlwa bya kumugela gwage. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Mone balya balimi bamutwalile gûlya mwingili, bamuhulile, no bamubwêlêshe minie samba. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Kûwa mwine bala utumine mwingili gûûngê kwa babele; gûndjo noge bamukomine kwê twee no bamutukile. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Utumine wa bûsatû, bamwiyagile; no baange bangê bahulilwe, no beyagilwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Muntu gûmo usigele kwa mwine bala ûbele mwana gee walê mukapwe. Nfulo, utumine noge kwabalê. Wêsambile: “Namanya kwana shabamwagamwe mwanage.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Mone balya balimi lwabamumwene wakûsha besongenie: “Gûdjû ûmpyana wabala lino. Nansi tumwiyage, no bala lino shalibe bûyana bwetû! <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Nfulo bamu kwatile gûlya mwana bamwiyagile bamutele andje gya bala lya misabibu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yesû ubulishe: “Mwine bala lya misabibu wakalonga ntee?” Gee wêkasha no kwêbeyaga balya balimi. “No lilya bala lya misabibu wêkebahaa bantû bange. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Nghib 118.22-23</ref></char></note>Hamwalisome lusinto bya lûle lwêsambe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Bwe libengilwe no bahimpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">Lilyo alibwe likata lya kihanda.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Mwanda gûno gwaima kwê Kolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">Nobyo bitûdjûdjû biiko kwatûlê!’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Babambile kûkeba bûlûle bwa kumukwata Yesû, mwanda basingûlwêle kwana lûlya lûkêndê lwalisambile kibalo kyabo. Mone batudjukile bantû bamulekele Yesû, no bagêle lwabo.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûbûsha kibalo kya musonko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Balya balambwili batumine bamo Bafalisayo no bengili ba Helode kibalo bamukwate kwa binengenwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Lwabaikile bamulombwele: “Mulangi, twasingûlûla kwana gwe wakwêsamba sitêê, onokûtûdjûka byakwêsamba bantû no ono kûagamwa muntû. Mone wakûlanga kwa sitêê ndjêla Kabesha Mpûngû gyalê mutakêshe kûlonda. Wetûlombole, bisila byetû bitûtakêshe kumua mubêkali wa Baloma musonko ao ûwe?” Tumue ao natukamui?<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Mone kwakûba Yesû umanyine nfika gyabo, wêbalombwele: “Kibalo kyakêê mwa ntompa? Mumpêle lûlo lûmea ni lûmone.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bamuêlêle lûmea, noge Yesû wêbabulishe: “Lûkebo lûlû lwêko no lûsinto lwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">“Bamuêndwêle bya Mubêkali,” wa Baloma.<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yesû wêbalombwele: “Mumue Mubêkali wa Baloma byage, no Kabesha Mpûngû mumue byage.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">No begalankenie biiko kibalo kya mpêndwe gyage.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bûsho kibalo kya kûshûka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />18 <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Bilb 23.8</ref></char></note>Masandukayo bakwêsamba kwana, hakûle kushûka, bamugêlêle Yesû no kumubusha: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Ngib 25.5</ref></char></note>“Mulangi, Musa wêtusintêle kwana: ‘Ntêê muntû ûkwelile mukasi, gee kûkya hakusiga mwana, mwanabo muyenene amutwale gûdjo madjû mukyêlwe kûba amubyalêle mwanabo baana.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Kûbele balûnda kiloba: gûlya mulûnda mutangi ûkwelile mukasi, ukile hakusiga mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Wabûbêlê umuyanine gûlya mwana mukasi, noge ukile hakumubyalêla mwana. Mwanabo wa bûsatû noge byonka nansilya, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />bonse kiloba bakile kûbula kusiga baana. Nfulo gya bonse gûdjo mwana mukasi ukile. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />No sigi lya kûshûka, kyaba kyabalê kashûka bonse, wêkaba mukasi wani mubukata bwabo? Kibalo bonse kiloba bekene naage nagwe mukasi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesû wêbalombwele: “Benywe mwimubûbê kibalo hamwidjê lusinto no bwêne bûkome bwa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Sigi lya kûshûka kwa baki, baana balûme no baana bakasi habakakwelani, bekaba nagwe masalagûlû gamwigûlû. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:6">Esl 3.6</ref></char></note>Kûlondana no bilya bya kushûka kwabaki, hamwalisome bûkû lya Musa, mukiba kilole kilya kihûdja kinkukile kaya Kabesha Mpûngû umulombwele Musa: ‘Nene ni Kabesha Mpûngû ka Bûlaimu, Kabesha Mpûngû ka Isaka, no Kabesha Mpûngû ka Shake.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Kabesha Mpûngû hawa baki, mone Kabesha Mpûngû ka bepoo. Kwasitê mwimubûbê.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisila kikata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lk 10.25-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mulangi gûmo wabisila ûtegelele kyaba Yesû kyabele waakanania no Basandukayo. Usingûlwêle kwana Yesû wêbaêndwêle bisoga, umushenenene no kumubûsha: “Bisila byonse bibi kisila kêê kikata?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Ngib 6.4-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû umuêndwêle: “Kisila kitangi ukino: ‘Tegelela, Isilaeli! Kolo Kabesha Mpûngû wetû ni Kolo gûmoolo. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Kampwa Kolo Kabesha Mpûngû obe kwa mutêma gobe gonse, kwa kikûle kyobe kyonse, kwa ngeni gyobe gyonse, no kwa bûkome bobe bonse.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Benlf 19.18</ref></char></note>Kisila kya bûbele kiino: ‘Kampwa mukuminkani nobe byolê mwikampwe gwe mwine.’ Hakûle kinge kisila kikata bikino.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:35">Ngib 4.35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gûlya mulangi wa bisila umulombwele Yesû: “Bisoga, Mulangi! Byonolisamba byasitêê: Kabesha Mpûngû gûmo no hakûle gûnge nambo gee. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Osey 6.6</ref></char></note>No muntû muyenene kumukampwa Kebesha Mpungu kwa mutêma kwage gonse, no kwa kikûle kyage kyonse, kwa ngeni gyage gyonse, kwa bûkome bwage bonse, no kûkanpwa mukuminkani nobe byolê mwikampwe gwe mwine, mianda gigyo gisoga mbeela kûlêmba kumulambûla Kabesha Mpûngû nyama gya kusigibwa kwa kaya no milambû ginge gyonse.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesû ûmwene kwana wêndwêle kwa lweni umulombwele: “Gwe awêkûla no Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Nghimba gya ao, hakûmonekile byonka muntû wakumubûsha Yesû kintû.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilisitu no Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesû lwabele mukûlanga mukisakye kya kitotelo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekaluni</char></note> ubulishe: “Muswelo kêê balangi ba bisila bakwêsamba kwana Kilisitu Mwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nghib 110.1</ref></char></note>Kibalo Daudi mulûbûlûlwe no Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke wêsambile:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Kolo Kabesha Mpûngû umulombwele Kolo lyane:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Gikana kûboko kwane kûlûme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Kuikêla andêkabêka maangi gyobe kunsê gya magûlû gobe.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Ntêê Daudi mwine wamwita: ‘Kolo’, wêbûba ntêê mwana ge?” Abele kibûngo kikata kimutegelele Yesû kwa mulogo.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walibalêngêla bantu kibalo kya balangi ba bisila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Mumilango gyage, Yesû wêsambile: “Mwilole no balangi babisila, bakampwe kûtamba bashale makanso gala no kwimunwa kwabûnyeme ebûlû ekukuminkena bantû, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />byonka nansho bakampwe kwêkana kubikanwa bya kûgêbwa mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi</char></note> no antû anyeme kukikwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bakuswinia lûheto lwa bakyêlwe no kûlomba milombelo gila, kibalo bamoneke kûgêbwa kwa bantu, kibalo kino bekamona bûkalabale mbeela!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulambû gwa madjû mukyêlwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Kûwa Yesû wêkene abwêê no kitala kya kûbêkêla mulambû, mukûlwegelela bantû, babele babêka lûheto lwabo. Ba mpeta bange babikile lûheto lwabo lûûngê munda gya kikyo kitala; <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />nfulo kusile mwana mukasi gûmo mukyêlwe nanda, ubikile lûmea lûbêlê lwa lûheto. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Kûwa Yesû wêbetile baana babûganga bage wêbalombwele: “Sitêê nanimilombola gûdjû mukyêlwe nanda wabêka lûûngê kûlêmba bantû bonse, babikile mukitala kya mulambû. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kibalo bantû bonse baimya kiba kya lûheto lwabo lwa babele nalo lûûngê; mone gee, waimya kwa bûlanda bwage, lûheto lwabele nalo lonse mumekano gage.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû walisamba kibalo kya konwa kwa kitotelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Nfulo Yesû lwabele waima mu nsese gya kitotelo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekalu</char></note> gûmo wa baana babûganga bage umulombwele: “Mulangi! Lola, bûlûlê mabwe gaga no mpimpêlo gigi bya gilê gya bitûdjûdjû!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Umuêndwêle: “Wamona mpimpêlo gigi gikata? Hakûle noline bwee limo likasigala egûlû lya linge; kintû kyonse kiongolwa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mudjembo no masûsû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesû kyaba kyabele mwikane kûlûgûlû lwa Mpasi, mubûlûlê bwa kitotelo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekalu</char></note> Petelo, Shake,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> Yoano no Andele, bamubulishe kûnkondo: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Wêtûlombole, mianda gino gikaba kyaba kêê? Byesha kêê bikalangêsha kwana mianda gino agikûbwêê kûgwanibwa?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesû ûbambile kwêbalombola: “Mube meso muntû nakasi kwimibemba. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Kibalo bangê bekasha kusina lyane, no kwêsamba: ‘Ninene ûge Kilisitu!’ Nobo bekabemba bantû bangê. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Kyaba kyamulê kategelela musahû gwa lûgosi no nganingani gya lûgosi, namukadjembi. Kiyenene mianda gigyo giimine, mone nfulo hagyaliike. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Kuana musoo gûmo gwêkalwa no musoo gûûnge; bûkolo bûmo bwêkalwa no bûkolo bûnge. Kwêkaimina haanda mu kandje hantû ala ala, kwêkaba lûûma lwa bya kûlya. Mianda gigi aginagwe mubambo gwa mûsûsû gatangi ga mwanamukasi wakûbyala mwana.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mt 10.17-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Lk 12.11-12</ref></char>
    </note>“Mone benywe mu tegelele bilya bya kemiikêla! Bantû bekemiila kûbangabanga. Be kemiûla mu nsese gya milombelo gya Bayuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi</char></note> bekemiila kûgêbwa kwa bakûlu ba bitenta no kwê babêkali kibalo kyane. Mwanda mu kansitêkêkye kûgêbwa kwabo. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Kiyenene bêlê mwanda gûsoga gûsahûlwe kumisoo gyonse. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Kyaba kyabalê kemikwata no kwimiila kûbangabanga, na mukabi mpewampewa namukakebi bilya byamulê kesamba, mone mwisambe gilya gyamulêkaebwa kyaba kyonka kilya, kwakûba habenywe bakwêsamba; nambo, Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mwanabo wakamuana mwanabo nage eyagwe, shage wakamuana mwanage eyagwe. Baana bekaba bamangi ba babyali babo nobo bekebeyagya. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mt 10.22</ref></char></note>No benywe mwakasikibwa no bantû bonse kibalo kya sina lyane. Mone gegense wêkalêndêla kuikêla nfulo, ûge wêkaanda.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masûsû gakata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayo 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Ndan 9.27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11.31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12.11</ref></char>
    </note>“Kyaba kyamulê kamona Kûûngêsha kwa bonenkania kwagimana antû alûmbûlûke.” Musomi no asingûlûle kibalo kyage, babo beku Bayuda batinine kûngûlû. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Lk 17.31</ref></char></note>No muntû gense wêkaba mukidjendje kya nsese nekatweli munda kûtwala mo kintû. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Gûlya noge wêkaba kwêbala nekebwilili kwage kûtwala kishandê kya mpeho kyage. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Musibo gwabo ba madjû bemite no bakonkya mu sigi lilyo! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mulombe Kabesha Mpûngû kibalo mianda gigyo nagikaimini kyaba kya mpeho!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bûkamu</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Ndan 12.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Mput 7.14</ref></char></note>Kibalo mumasigi gago kwêkaimina masûsû gakata gashalimweke kûbambêle sigi lilya Kabesha Mpûngû ehangile kandje kuikêla noano. No hakûkaimini byonka masûsû bigano. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ntêê Kolo aswele kûtaûla masigi gago, hakûswele kûba muntû wakûhanda; mone wêgatawêle masigi gago kibalo kya basololwa bage. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Kyaba kikyo muntû gee kwimilombola: ‘Mulole, Kilisitu!’ Wêano ao, ‘Wêkulya!’ Namuketabêsha. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kibalo kwêkaimina ba Kilisitu no bamoni ba buumpi, nobo bekalonga kabandêlêlo kabyesha no bitudjûdjû, kibalo kya kûlûbya, ntêê byabilê binyonghokele, baswa kûlûbya no basololwa ba Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Mone benywe mube meso! Kibalo nanimilombola mianda gyonse kûgêbwa agyaliikêle.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">1 Kûsha kwa Mwana wa Muntû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isay 13.10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Esek 32.7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:15">3.15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Mput 6.12</ref></char>
    </note>“Kûwa masigi gago, masûsû agalê kawa, djûba lya kaba kidjo, no kwesi hakukankeki, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isay 34.4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Yow 2.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Mput 6.13</ref></char></note>no tûmbalambala twa egûlû twakagwêla, no bûkome bwa mwigûlû bwê katingina. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Ndan 7.13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Mput 1.7</ref></char></note>Ao bekamumona Mwana wa Bantû, wakûsha mumalesigûlû no bûkome bûûngê no ntumbo. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Kyaba kilya wêkatuma bamasalagûlû no kukuminkania basololwa bage kuima mpenga gyonse gina gya kandje, kuima nfulo gya kandje no nfulo gya gûlû.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê kibalo kya mutê gwa kikûdjû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“No mwilange kuima kumutê gwa kikûdjû Kyaba matabê gage agesenene no mani gage gatintila, musingûlûle kwana kyaba kya bûdjogo kyaikêla. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />No benywe kûmona mianda gigyo ntêê agyakwika, musingûlûle kwana Mwana wa Muntû wêkûbwêhê, no wêkumushango. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Sitêê nanimilombola benywe muso gûno hagûkaite ntêê mianda gigyo gyonse hagyaliimine. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Gûlû no kandje bikaêta, mone mianda gyane agikahiti mbeela.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hakûle muntû mumanye sigi no kyaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayo 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mt 24.36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mone, hakûle muntû mumanye, sigi no kyaba kikyo; no gene masalagûlû gamwigûlû, no Mwana; nambo Tata bugima bwage umumanye. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mube meso no mulombe, kibalo hamwidjê byakelêka kyaba kêê. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Lk 12.36-38</ref></char></note>Kikaba nagwe muntû wêmulwendo, usigile nsese gyage ûwele muntû gense mugêlo gwage no kûtakêsha muhempi wamushango abe meso. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Nfulo mube meso, kibalo hamwidjè mwine nsese kyaba kyalêkasha; ntêê lêngolo ao mumandê ga busigi ao akûbêlêkela kwa nkoko ao mugûndja. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ntêê washa kimpûlû mpandja, nakasi kwêmitana mubêdjê. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />No gûgo gwa nanimilombola benywe, nanimilombola bonse: mube meso!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Sondjelo lya kumwiyaga Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoano 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kuim 12.1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kusigele masigi gabêlê kuikêla sigi likata lya Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kûêta egûlû</char></note> no lya mikate gisi no kidjûsho. Bakûlû ba balambwili no balangi babisila babele bakeba ndjêla gyakumukwata Yesû kwabubisa no kumwiyage. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kûwa besambile: “Na tûkalongi nansino kyaba kya kikwe, ntê anansho bantû swabalonge fulugo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wasingwa Makita mu Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoano 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Lk 7.37-38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû ûbele Betania, mu nsese gya Simo wêno bûsûngû. Kyaba kyabele mwikane kumutalako kûlya kyakûlya, mwana mukasi gûmo ûtwelile ûbele no lûnengo lwa alabasita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">alabasisita nisina lya supa libele lyabêkwa makita galanado</char></note> lûbele lûdjûle makita ga nalado gabele gasoga gakitûngo kikata, utimwine lûlo lûnengo, ûkûnkwêle gago makita mwi twee lya Yesû. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Abele no bantû baange bakolelwe biiko no beninghininie bobene: “Kibalo kyakê kusiminia bibê makita gaga? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Gaswa kûnyonghokela kusibwa lûkama mia gisatû gya lûheto, no kûebwa balanda!” Bamukankêle gûdjo mwanamukasi.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Mone Yesû wêbalombwele, “Mumulekele! Kibalo kyakê mwamudjembya nansho? Wanongela mwanda gûsoga biiko. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Ngib 15.11</ref></char></note>Balanda mwikaba nabo masigi gonse, no mwibûnyonghona kwêbakwasha kyaba kyonse kya mwakeba. Mone nene amubi nane masigi gonse. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Gûdjû mwanamukasi wanongela gûlya gwenyonghwene kûlonga. Wakûnkwêla mubêlê gwane makita kûbêka djambûla mashêko gane. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Sitê nanimilombola, kûntû konkonse kwê kasahûlwa mwanda gûsoga mukandje, kilongwakiki gyalongile gûdjû mwanamukasi kikesambwa kwa kumwidjûkana.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wamuhana Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Kûwa Yuda Esikaliota, gûmo mu balya baana babûganga kumi no babêlê, wêbaikêle bakûlû ba balambwili kûba amuane Yesû kwabalê. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Nobo balogelelwe biiko balagêlêle kumua lûheto. Kwanansho Yuda ûkebile kyaba kiyenene kya kumuana Yesû.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikwe kya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22.7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoano 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Sigi litangi lya kikwe kya mikate gisigibêkwe kidjûsho, usigi lyababele basêndja mwana mukoko uimibwe mulambû kibalo kya pasaka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kûsela egûlû</char></note> baana babûganga bage bamubulishe: “Wakeba tûgye kwê kûba tûkûlongele djambûla hantû akûlya pasaka?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kûsela egûlû</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Nansho Yesû wêbatumine babêlê mubalya baana babûganga bage, wêbalombwele: “Mugye mu kibûndê, mumo mwakakuminkana no mwana mulûme mutwale kibêndê kya madjê. Mumulonde, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />kuikêla mu nsese gilya gyene katwela, mukamulombole mwine nsese: ‘Mulangi wabûsha, ninkwê kwê kyûmba kikata kyakûlêla pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kûsela egûlû</char></note> no baana babûganga bage?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Noge shaemilangêshe kyûmba kikata kya egûlû, kilêngûlwe no kibikilwe djambûla. Ûkûko kosha wêtûtekele kya kulya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Baana babûganga basemukile, bagêle mukibûndê, basangene bintû byonse nagwe nansilya Yesû byalibalombwele; nobo balongishe kikwe kya Pasaka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kûêta egûlû</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Alishabele lêngolo, Yesû ûgêle amo no balya kumi no babêlê. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Nghib 41.9</ref></char></note>Lwababele kumutalako mukûlya, Yesû wêsambile: “Sitêê nanimilombola gûmo wenyu wakûlya amo nane wakampana.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Baana babûganga bage bahûngêlwe, bamubulishe, gûmo gûmo: “Ntêê! Ni nene?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesû wêbaêndwêle; “Gûmo mubûkata bwenyu kumi no babêlê, wêkakunya amo no nene mukikobwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Sitê, Mwana wa Muntû wagya eyagwe nagwe Lusinto Lûlûmbûlûke bya lûlê lwêsambe kibalo kyage, mone musibo gwage muntû gûlya wêka muana Mwana wa Muntû! Kyaswakûba kyalyese kwa muntû gûlya wasi mubyalwe!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikwe kya Kolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bakolinto 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Nobo lwababele mukûlya, Yesû ûtwalile mukate, no kufwisha Kabesha Mpûngû, wêgutimwine. “Wêbaele no kwêsamba,” mutwale, “gûgû umubêlê gwane.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Kûwa ûtwalile kikobwa, gee kufwisha Kabesha Mpûngû, wêbaele; bekubile bonse. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kuim 24.8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yelem 31.31-34</ref></char></note> wêbalombwele: “Gano ûmasi ga kilageno, gakwêsêka kibalo kya bantû bonse. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Sitê, nani milombola, nsikekûbêla byonka difai lya bihelo bya misabibu kuikêla sigi lilya lya ndêkekûbêla difai liya mubûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Kûwa bembile lwêmbo basemukile bagêle kûlûgûlû lwa Maasi.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walagûla kwana Petelo wa kamwitune</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoano 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Sak 13.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesû wêbalombwele baana babûganga bage: “Benywe bonse mwikansiga bugima bwane, kibalo Lusinto Lûlûmbûlûke lwalisamba, ‘nikamuhûla muempi, nogyo mikoko gikasangalala.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mt 28.16</ref></char></note>Kyaba kyandê kashûka, nikemitangêlêla kû Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petelo umulombwele: “Nontê bonse bokukusiga, nene nsikakusigi noeneasho!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesû umuêndwêle Petelo: “Sitê, nankûlombola busigi bûno, kûgêbwa kwa kadjendje kûbêlêkêla lûkwe lwa bûbêlê, shaunitune nko gisatû.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Mone Petelo ûkonkomekile: “Nontê kiyenene nkye amo nogwe, nkiso kûkûbenga mbeela!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">No bonse besambile byonka nansho.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walomba mulûbanda lwa Getesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Nfulo, baikile mu lûbanda lwitilwe Getesemani, wêbalombwele baana babûganga bage: “Mwikane ano kyaba kyandê mukûlomba.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Kûwa wêbatwalile Petelo, Shake,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> no Yoano. Ûbambile kûdjemba biiko no kûtegelela mwenyo. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Wêbalombwele: “Nimuhûngêlwe biiko kûmutêma abûsho kûkya. Mwikane ano no kûkelwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Yesû ûgêle kûgebwa bisho, ukutamine ansê kûlomba Kabesha Mpûngû kwana, ntê kyokûnyonghokela, kyaba kino kya masûsû kimpête. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />“Wêsambile Tata,” ntê kyokûnyonghokela, “Nsindwêle masûsû gano! Mone nabikabi byandê mukampêlwe nene. Nambo, molê mukampêlwe gwee.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Kûwa wêbwêlêle kwêbaana babûganga balya basatû wêbasangene mutûlo. Umulombwele Petelo: “Simo wêmutûlo? Awêmunyonghone kûkelwa nokine kyaba kimo!” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />No wêbalombwele: “Mukelwe no kûlomba, kûba namukasi kûtwela mu bitompibwa. Mutêma gwi ndii, mone mubêlê gwawa kûkêma.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ugêle kûlomba byonka, wêbwêlêlêle mianda gyonka gilya. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Kûwa wêbwêlêle byonka; wêbasangene bemutûlo meso gabo gabele ganyemenwe notûlo. Habamanyine kya kumuêndûla.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Wêbaikêle lûkwe lwa bûsatû, wêbalombwele: “Mwalala byonka nokwêtûsha? Byawa! Kyaba kyaikêla Mwana wa Muntû wabêkwa mumaboko ga bantû babê. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mubyûke, tûgye lwetû. Mulole, gûlya wakampana washena!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûkwatwa kwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoano 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesû lwabele onka mukwêsamba, Yuda gûmo wabalya kumi no babêlê, uwikile amo no kibungo kya bantû bamo no bipanga, baange no tûbonge, bantû babo babele batumwe no balambwili bakûlû, balangi babisila, no batata nkûlû. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />No gûlya umuanine wêbaele kabandêlêlo: “Gûlya wansha ntomone,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lwimu lwa milomo</char></note> gûdjo ûge mumukwate mugyate nage mumulwegelele biiko.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yuda aikile, lûkwe lûmo ûgêle kwê Yesû no kwêsamba: “Mulangi!” Kûwa umutomwene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lwimu lwa milomo</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Nfulo babo bantû bolwele maboko gabo no kumukwata Yesû. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Gûmo wa baana babûganga ba Yesû ûsangenwe ao ulumwine lûpanga no kumukala kûtwê mwingili wa mulambwili mukûlû. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesû wêbalombwele: “Mwasha kûntwala nene mwalê no bipanga no tûbonge, nagwe ni ntomboki? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19.47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21.37</ref></char></note>Masigi gonse mbele nenyu amo mukûlanga mukisakyê kyakitotelo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekaluni</char></note> no hamunkwatile. Mone mianda gino gyaikêla kûba lwandêko lûgwanine.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Ûao baana babûganga bonse bamulekele batinine.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kûbele musongwa lûme gûmo, ûbele wamulonda Yesû, mushale lûbega kumubêlê gwage, bamukwatile, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />noge wilusigile lûlya lûbega, utinine mutaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû mubangabanga lya batata nkûlû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayo 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoano 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Nfulo bamutwalile Yesû kumwila kwê mulambwili mukûlû, kukuminkene bakûlû ba balambwili no batata nkûlû no basinti babisila. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Noge Petelo ûbele wamulonda Yesû katwe kala no kehê, no ûtwelile mukisakyê kya nsese gya mulambwili mukûlû. Ûbele mwikane amo no baempi mukonta kaya. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Nfulo bakûlû ba balambwili no kilye kyonse kikebile kusitêkêkya kwana Yesû mubê bamwiyage, mone habamwene. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Mwanda bangêê bamusitêkêkye Yesû bumpi, mone kusitêkêkya kwabo hakûkwelenkene.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />No bange bemene bamusitêkêkye bumpi banine: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.58: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoa 2.19</ref></char></note>“Betwe tumutegelele muntû gûdjû wakwêsamba kwana: ‘Nene nankaongola kitotelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekalu</char></note> kino kiimpilwe kumaboko ga bantû, no mumasigi gasatû nankaimpa kiinge kisikaimpwa kumaboko ga bantû.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />No nansho, kusitêkêkya kwabo hakûkwelenkene.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Nghimba mulambwili mukûlû wêmene abûkata bwa bantû no umubulishe Yesû: “Onokwêndûla byonse byaba kukusitêkêkya?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Mone wêkene talala, no haêndwêle mwanda. Mulambwili mukûlû umubulishe byonka, umulombwele: “Gwee ûge Kilisitu, Mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû muyenene kûtûmbêkwa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.62: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Ndan 7.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Yesû umuindwêle,” ninene no mwikamona Mwana wa Muntû, “mwikane kûboko kûlûme kwa Kabesha Mpûngû wêno bûkome no wêkasha mu malesigûlû ga mwigûlû!”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Mulambwili mukûlû ûsanine kishandê kyage wêsambile: “Twêno kibalo kê byonka kya kamoni! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.64: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Benlf 24.16</ref></char></note>Mwategelela nansilya byana kûtûka Kabesha Mpûngû. Mwamona ntê?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Bonse bakalile nsambû kwana: muyenene eyagwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bange babambile kumushêlêla mata, bamuutile kûlûkebo no kumuhûla bikoni. Bamulombwele. “Lagûla!” Nani wakûlonga nansino, nobo bengili bamubatile mahê.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wamwituna Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayo 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoano 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />No kyaba Petelo ûbele ansê mukisakyê, kusile mwingili mwana mukasi gûmo wa mulambwili mukûlû. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ûmumwene Petelo wakonta kaya, umulwele soo umulombwele: “Nogwe, ûbele amo no Yesû gûlya Munasaleti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Mone Petelo witunine: “Nsidjê no nsha kusinghûlûla byono kwêsamba.” Kûwa wimine andje akûtwelela mukisakyê, no kadjendje kabêlêkêle.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />No gûlya mwingili mwana mukasi umumwene byonka ubambile kwêbalombola babele bemane alya: “Gûdjû ûgûmo wabo!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petelo witunine byonka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Kyaba kisho balya babele alya bamulombwele byonka Petelo: “Sitê gwee wêgûmo wabo, kibalo nogwe wê Mugalilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />“Kûwa Petelo wêsambile: Kabesha Mpûngû nontê mulago ntê nambea! Nanidjêgêla nsidjê muntû gûdjo wamwa kwêsamba!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Lwendo lûmo kadjendje kabêlêkêle lûkwe lwa bûbêlê, Petelo wêdjûkene kilya kinia kye lombwelwe no Yesû: “Kadjendje byakasha libêlêkêle lûkwe lwa bûbêlê, shaunitune nko gisatû.” No eningile, ulilile.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesû mbelê gya Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoano 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Lukindwe bwee bakûlû ba balambwili balongile sondjelo, amo no batata nkûlû, balangi babisila, no kilye kikata. Lwabawêle kumukwêka migosi, bamuilile kwê Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato umubulishe Yesû: “Gwe ûge Kolo lya Bayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesû umuêndwêle: “Nigwe walisamba.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Nobo bakûlû ba balambwili babele bamusongela Yesû ku mianda gingê. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Kûwa Pilato umubulishe byonka: “Onokwêndûla mwanda? Wategelela byonse byaba kûsongela!”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Noge Yesû haêndwêle mwanda byonka, no mwine Pilato wêgalagenie.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wakalelwa nsambû gya kûkya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoano 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kyaba kyonse kya sigi likata lya Pasaka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kûêta egûlû</char></note> Pilato wêdjêbêle kwêbasokwena mukwêkwe gûmo gûlya wabasolwele bantû. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Kyaba kikyo, kûbele muntû gûmo sina lyage Balaba ûbele mutatwe amo no bantomboki beyagene kyaba kya fulugo. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Kibûngo kisile kûsense gya Pilato kumulomba ebalongele nansilya byebele mwidjêbêle. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato wêbaêndwêle: “Mwakeba nimisokwene Kolo lya Bayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Wêsambile nansilya kibalo usingûlwêle kwana bakûlû ba balabwili bamuanine Yesû kwa bûkwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Mone bakûlû babalambwili basomenkenie bantû kwana, Pilato ebasokwene Balaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Byonka Pilato wêbabulishe bantû: “Shatûlonge kê gûno wamwakwêta Kolo lya Bayuda?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Babûlwêle byonka no besambile: “Akolekwe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato wêbalombwele: “Bûbê kêê bwalongile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Mone bagêlêlêle kûbûlûla: “Akolekwe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato ûkebile kûnenghesha kibûnago, wêbasokwene Balaba. Kûwa kumukusha Yesû nswi, no ûmwanine akolekwe.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basilêkalê bamusompwela Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayo 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoano 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Basilêkalê bamwilile Yesû mu bangabanga, munda gya sense gya mubêkali nobo betile kibûngo kya basilêkale kyonse kikuminkene. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bamushikile Yesû kishandê kya mpeho kitêlêle, baotwele nkata gya miiba, bamubikile kwê twe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Kûwa babambile kumwimuna no kwêsamba: “Lwimu Kolo lya Bayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bamukusile lûlenge kwêtwe, bamushêlêle mata, bamukutamine, no kumutota. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />No lwabawêle kumusopwela, bamushulile kishandê kilya, bamushikile bishandê byage mwine. Bamuilile andje mwanda bamukoleke.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wakolekwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoano 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Balom 16.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Muntû gûmo sina lyage Simo wa Mukilene, shabo wa Isikanda no Lufo, ûbele waêta alya mukuima kûmabala; basilêkalê bamukonkeleshe atwale mutê gwa mpênga mpêtya gwa Yesû. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Bamuilile Yesû antû akwêtwa Gologota, sintwe gyage: “Antû akûdja lya twee.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bamuele difai lisangelêlwe no mananange, mone gee ûbengile kwêkûbêla. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:18">Ngib 22.18</ref></char></note>Kûwa bamukolekile Yesû kumutê gwa mpêngampêtya, batele kishandê kyage bûbale, kibalo bamanye kintû kê kibûtwala gûmo mu bishandê bya Yesû. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Akigwanine kyaba kya djûba lya kyonta bakote nobo bamukolekile. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Abele no Lusinto lwa kûlangêsha kibalo kya kûkolekwa kwage, Lusintilwe kwana: “Kolo lya Bayuda.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isay 53.12</ref></char></note>Amo no Yesû ûkolekilwe no baswinanya babêlê, gûmo kûboko kwage kûlûme no gûnge kûboko kwage kûkasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Kwanasho lûgwanine Lûsinto lwêsambilwe, “ûbalêlêlwe amo no baswinanya.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Nghib 22.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109.25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Malk 14.58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoa 2.19</ref></char>
    </note>Nobo babele baêta mundjêla bamutukile no kuukumia matwe gabo banine: “Aaah! Gwe ûkebile kubungula kitotelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekaluni</char></note> no kuimpa kinge mu masigi gasatû! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Wêhandie gwe mwine tûka kumutê gwa mpênga mpêtya!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Byonka nansho bakûlû ba balambwili no balangi babisila, bamusompwele Yesû no kwêsongenia besambile: “Mulole ûhandishe bange, mone wagandwa kwê handya gemwine! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Kilisitu, Kolo lya Isilaeli, atûke anompe kumutê gwa mpêmgapêtya, ntêê twamona watûka shatûmwitabêshe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">No bene balya bakolekilwee nage amo noobo bamutukile.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luki lwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoano 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kûbamba kyaba kya meeno kenene, kuikêla kyaba kya djûba lyahûla malelo, abele kidjo egûlû lya kandje konse. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:1">Ngib 22.1</ref></char></note>Djûba aliulile malelo, Yesû ûbûlwêle djûê likata: “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakatani” kusintûla kwage: “Kabesha Mpûngû wane, Kabesha Mpûngû wane, mwanda gwakê wandekela?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />No bantû bamo babele alya bamutegelele, besambile: “Tegelela, wamwita Elia!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Nghib 69.21</ref></char></note>No gûmowabo ûgêle lûbelo, kûtwala musompo kûtomia mu difai lya bûsoswe, no kwêgûbêka kûlûlenge. Umuele ekûbêle, wêsambile: “Muleke tûmone ntêê Elia swaashe kumutûkya kumutê gwa mpêngampêtya!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Mone Yesû wiminie djûê likata, no ukile.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kuim 26.31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Kikêngo kya kitotelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hekaluni</char></note> kyatikile biba bibêlê, kûbamba egûlû kuika ansê. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ntwasha wabasilêkale wa Baloma, ûbele mwimane alya lwamwene wakala Mutêma muswelo gûgo, wêsambile: “Sitê muntû gûdjû ûbele mwana wa Kabesha Mpûngû!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Lk 8.2-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Abele no baana bakasi babêlê balwele kûlampee; mubûkata mwabo abele Malia Mandalena, Malia nyage wa Shake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> mwanike, Yose no Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bano bamulondile Yesû abele Galilaya no kumukwasha. Kûbele no baana bakasi bange bengê basile Yelusalema amo nage.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû washêkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoano 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Kyaba kya lêngolo akiikile. Lilyo libele sigi lya bûlongololi, kwana lya kûbyûkêla sigi lya kwetûsha kwa Bayuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Ao asile Yosefu mwine wa Alimataya, ûbele muntû munyeme mukilye kya bakûlû, noge ûbele wahempa Bûkolo bwa Kabesha Mpûngû. Kwa nansho ûgêle kwa kûbûla mwenyo kwê Pilato, kwa kumulomba mubêlê gwa Yesû. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato wêgalagenie biiko kibalo kyakûtegelela kwana Yesû wawa kûkya. Nfulo, umwitile gûlya ntwasha wabasilêkale wa Baloma no kumubûsha kwana Yesû ntêê wakyanga kala. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />No awêle kûtegelela mpêndwe gya gûlya ntwasha wabasilêkale wa Baloma, Pilato umutakêshe Yosefu kûtwala mubêle gwage. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Noge Yosefu ulile malekani gamunke, usindwêle mubêlê gwa Yesû kumutê gwa mpêngampêtya, umuombile malekani, umubikile mukilêbû kisongwe mwibwe. Kûwa ulundumwine bwee likata kusika kumushango gwa kilêbû. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Nobo Malia Mandalena no Malia nyage wa Yose balwele antû abikilwe Yesû.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kûshûka kwa Yesû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoano 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Nghimba gya sigi lya kwêtûsha lya Bayuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sabato</char></note> Malia Mandalena, Malia nyage wa Shake,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo</char></note> Salome, bolile makita gabusiko bûsoga kûba begunsinge mubêlê gwa Yesû. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Lukindwe bwee sigi ya djênga, djûba alibambile kuima, bagêle kukilêbû. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3-4" />Nobo babele balibûsenia: “Nani wêketwiminia lilya bwee likata kumushango gwa kilebû?” Mone lwabalwele, bamwene bwee lyawa kulundumunwa ankondo; nolyo libele likata biiko. <verse eid="MRK 16:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Lwabatwelile mukilêbû, bamwene nsongwa lûme mwikane mugela gwa kûboko kûlûme, mushale bishandê bimunke nobo batudjukile biiko. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Mone nsongwa gûdjo wêbalombwele: “Namukatudjuki, mwakumukeba Yesû Munasaleti ûkolekilwe kumutê gwa mpêngampêtya, gee washûka mulolo antû abele mubêkwe ûano. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mt 26.32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Malk 14.28</ref></char></note>Nfulo mugyate mukebalombole baana babûganga, no Petelo kwana: ‘Walimitangêlêla kûgya Galilaya kûko mwakamumona monka mwelimilombwelele.’”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Kûwa baimine kûkilêbû, no kûbamba lûbêlo babele mukukwaka no kwêgalagania biiko. No habalombwele muntû mwanda, kibalo batudjukile biiko.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wa muimina Malia Mandalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoano 20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesû lwawêle kûshûka lukindwe kusigi litangi lya djênga, umuimine bêlê Malia Mandalena, kwana uwimibwe minyaga gibê munda gyage. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Ûbambwêle ndjêla, wêbaele musahû balya babele amo nage Yesû, kyaba kikyo babele ba tompola no kûlêla. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Mone lwabamutegelele walisamba kwana Yesû wêpo noge umumwene, habamwitabêshe.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walibaimina baana babûganga babêlê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Nghimba gya ao, Yesû wêbaimine babêlê mubalya baana babûganga ûmonekile muswelo gûnge kyaba kya babele bagya kwêbala. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Lwabebwêlêle kwêbahêla musahû balya baange, nobo habebetabêshe.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû walibaimina baana babûganga bage kumi no gûmo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoano 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bilongwa bya Bikûla 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Nghimba ûbaimine balya kumi no gûmo ababele balya. Wêbakankêle kwakûbûla lwêtabêsho lwabo, no lûma lwa mitêma gyabo kwakûba abebetabêshe balya bamumwene nghimba gya kushûka kwage. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Bilb 1.8</ref></char></note>Kûwa wêbalombwele: “Mugyate mu kandje konse, mukasahûle musahû gûsoga kû bantû bonse. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Wakwêtabêsha no kûbatisibwa wakahanda. Mone usiketabêsha wakamona bûkalabale. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Mulole tûbandêlêlo tûno twakalondana no balya beketabêsha: kusina lyane bakaimya minyaga gibe, bekesamba kwalulimi lûya, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />be kakwata ndjoka nontê bo kwêkûbêla bûlembe bobonse bwa kwêyaga, ha bûkemidjembya mbeela; be katenteka maboko gabo kûbatongi, nobo bekaanda.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesû wasela mwigûlû</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bilongwa bya Bikûla 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9">Bilb 1.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kolo Yesû lwabidjile kwêsamba nabo, ûtekwinwe mwigûlû, no kwêkana kûboko kûlûme kwa Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Nobo baana babûganga bagêle mu kûsahûla mpenga gyonse, Kolo wêngêle nabo amo, no kûkonkomeka musahû gwage kû ndjêla gya tûbandêlêlo tûlondene nabo.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>